#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#204 (mes)
- "[Isac Mari]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#205 (mes)
- "If you bring all the items then I will make it for you right away. See you later~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#206 (mes)
- "[Isac Mari]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#207 (mes)
- "Opera Phantom Mask..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#208 (mes)
- "Frightening, but also tragic and romantic. If you brought all the required items, I will make it for you~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#209 (mes)
- "[Isac Mari]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#210 (mes)
- "But can you check that the items in your inventory aren't upgraded or have cards compounded into them? If any of the required items have forged upgrades or cards, those will be lost once I create the Opera Masque."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#211 (mes)
- "[Isac Mari]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#212 (mes)
- "It's better to keep only the items used to make the Opera Mask in your inventory. Did you check? If so, let's get started."
