- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#242 (mes)
- "Bread, fruits, vegetables..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#243 (mes)
- "Bleh. All that other food is"
