#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#251 (mes)
- "Komodoru meat all day when"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#252 (mes)
- "you go BBQ camping. Komodoru"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#253 (mes)
- "is an animal native to Comodo"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#254 (mes)
- "and every part of it is delicious. Every. Single. Morsel."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#255 (mes)
- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#256 (mes)
- "What makes this meat even"
