#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#260 (mes)
- "addictive. Without it, we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#261 (mes)
- "can't start our barbeque!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#262 (mes)
- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#263 (mes)
- "If we settled on anything"
