- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#269 (mes)
- "Say, would you do us a favor?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#270 (mes)
- "The Chief of Comodo was going"
