#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#274 (mes)
- "cancel because of his duties."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#275 (mes)
- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#276 (mes)
- "Let's see, our Chief lives to"
