#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#279 (mes)
- "what's taking him so long"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#280 (mes)
- "to get over here?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#281 (mes)
- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#282 (mes)
- "You know, people gather"
