#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#285 (mes)
- "that have fallen in battle"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#286 (mes)
- "against the witch of Comodo."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#287 (mes)
- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#288 (mes)
- "Long before Comodo was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#289 (mes)
- "built inside this huge cave,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#290 (mes)
- "this witch used to live in here. A lot of people died trying to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#291 (mes)
- "get rid of her, but there're rumors that she's still around..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#292 (mes)
- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#293 (mes)
- "Komodoru meat is especially"
