+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#297 (mes)
- "fame! You should try some~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#298 (mes)
- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#299 (mes)
- "Speaking of which, our Chief"
