#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#302 (mes)
- "see what's taking him so long?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#303 (mes)
- "His house is located west of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#304 (mes)
- "these campgrounds."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#305 (mes)
- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#306 (mes)
- "Oh, hey, you're back."
