#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#323 (mes)
- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#324 (mes)
- "It's really too bad that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#325 (mes)
- "he can't join us. Ah, I've got"
