- "[Rochito]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#347 (mes)
- "Oh, hey there~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#348 (mes)
- "Thanks for helping us"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#349 (mes)
- "out earlier. I wish the"
