#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#357 (mes)
- "but I can give you a hot tip."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#358 (mes)
- "There's some guy at the local"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#359 (mes)
