#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#363 (mes)
- "cave that Comodo was built"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#364 (mes)
- "in... Anyway, I really get the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#365 (mes)
- "feeling that it just might"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#366 (mes)
- "lead to something, you know?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#367 (mes)
- "[Rockha]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#368 (mes)
- "Oh man..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#369 (mes)
- "I'm so excited!"
