#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#381 (mes)
- "Huh, why isn't he here yet?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#382 (mes)
- "[Rockha]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#383 (mes)
- "Anyway, even though"
