#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#385 (mes)
- "changed, thankfully we're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#386 (mes)
- "still friends. It's kinda weird, though, being on a first name"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#387 (mes)
- "basis with a village chief."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#388 (mes)
- "[Rockha]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#389 (mes)
- "Makes me feel..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#390 (mes)
- "Important. I'm hobnobbing"
