- "friends can end up in life..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#394 (mes)
- "[Rockha]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#395 (mes)
- "I've almost forgotten"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#396 (mes)
- "how much I love hanging"
