- "^3355FFComodo Cheese^000000 that I heard"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#431 (mes)
- "about from ^3355FFToruna^000000. Sure, it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#432 (mes)
- "might not exist, but still...!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#433 (mes)
- "[Rockha]"
+ ""
