+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#439 (mes)
- "responsible must be rough..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#440 (mes)
- "[Rockha]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#441 (mes)
