- "the Village Chief here, and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#445 (mes)
- "some of that legendary Comodo Cheese that ^3355FFToruna^000000 told me about."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#446 (mes)
- "[Emralhandas]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#447 (mes)
- "Rockha, let me pour"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#448 (mes)
- "you another drink. We"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#449 (mes)
- "always dreamed of this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#450 (mes)
- "during the War of the Witch..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#451 (mes)
- "Having a good time, all of us"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#452 (mes)
- "together in a time of peace~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#453 (select)
- "War of the Witch?:Cancel"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#454 (mes)
- "[Emralhandas]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#455 (mes)
- "Before I tell you about the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#456 (mes)
- "War of the Witch, I guess"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#457 (mes)
- "I should tell you about the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#458 (mes)
- "quest to retrieve 4 rare swords"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#459 (mes)
- "of power, said to be the most"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#460 (mes)
- "powerful weapons ever made."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#461 (mes)
- "[Emralhandas]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#462 (mes)
- "Now, all 4 swords were"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#463 (mes)
- "successfully found 10 years"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#464 (mes)
- "after the search began. Then,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#465 (mes)
- "4 protectors were chosen to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#466 (mes)
- "ensure that the swords did"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#467 (mes)
- "not fall into the wrong hands."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#468 (mes)
- "[Emralhandas]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#469 (mes)
- "You might not think so just"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#470 (mes)
- "by looking at us, but we were"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#471 (mes)
- "the protectors--me, Rockha,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#472 (mes)
- "Rochito, and Tausupa, the chief"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#473 (mes)
- "of this village. Now, we guarded these weapons very carefully..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#474 (mes)
- "[Emralhandas]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#475 (mes)
- "However, that didn't deter"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#476 (mes)
- "Mariposum, ancient witch of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#477 (mes)
- "Comodo, from attacking us and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#478 (mes)
- "trying to steal the swords. She"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#479 (mes)
- "was incredibly powerful, and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#480 (mes)
- "we needed an army to fight her."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#481 (mes)
- "[Emralhandas]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#482 (mes)
- "That was the War of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#483 (mes)
- "Witch, basically. Mariposum"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#484 (mes)
- "with her own strange weapon"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#485 (mes)
- "of mass destruction against the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#486 (mes)
- "four of us backed by a large"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#487 (mes)
- "force of courageous soldiers."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#488 (mes)
- "[Emralhandas]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#489 (mes)
- "Many of our comrades died..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#490 (mes)
- "But finally we succeeded in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#491 (mes)
- "imprisoning the witch by using"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#492 (mes)
- "the power of the swords. Yeah,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#493 (mes)
- "if it weren't for Tausupa, we'd"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#494 (mes)
- "never have been able to do it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#495 (mes)
- "[Emralhandas]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#496 (mes)
- "Rockha, we still have"
