- "Let's just stuff ourselves..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#501 (mes)
- "All the way until tommorrow!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#502 (mes)
- "[Rotute]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#503 (mes)
- "Years ago, there was a huge"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#504 (mes)
- "quest to retrieve 4 rare swords"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#505 (mes)
- "of incredible power, supposedly"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#506 (mes)
- "the strongest swords ever made!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#507 (mes)
- "But you know, there's a strange"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#508 (mes)
- "rumor about a secret 5th sword."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#509 (mes)
- "[Rotute]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#510 (mes)
- "This 5th sword is supposed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#511 (mes)
- "to be hidden near Glastheim."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#512 (mes)
- "If it does exist, it might have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#513 (mes)
- "the power to change the world!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#514 (mes)
- "Isn't that freakin' scary?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#515 (mes)
- "[Rotute]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#516 (mes)
- "Hey, isn't that Koserahserah?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#517 (mes)
- "That's the best seasoning that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#518 (mes)
- "you can have for meat dishes!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#519 (mes)
- "Oh, you got that from the Chief"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#520 (mes)
- "to give to Rochito? Wow, they"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#521 (mes)
- "must be really good friends..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#522 (mes)
- "[Rotute]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#523 (mes)
- "Hello, thanks for helping"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#524 (mes)
- "out Rockha, Rochito and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#525 (mes)
