- "me since I was born, so it's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#527 (mes)
- "like they're family to me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#528 (mes)
- "[Rotute]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#529 (mes)
- "One of the reasons that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#530 (mes)
- "they brought me here to"
