- "I guess he's too busy now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#534 (mes)
- "Still, I like this place!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#535 (mes)
- "[Rinta]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#536 (mes)
- "I didn't mean to,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#537 (mes)
- "but I accidentally"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#538 (mes)
- "eavesdropped on those"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#539 (mes)
- "people over there. Are"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#540 (mes)
- "they really old friends"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#541 (mes)
- "with our Village Chief?"
