+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#547 (mes)
- "the like. Or something like that."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#548 (mes)
- "[Razy]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#549 (mes)
- "Those people over there"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#550 (mes)
- "are friends of the Village"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#551 (mes)
- "Chief? I was wondering about"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#552 (mes)
- "them for the longest time..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#553 (mes)
- "I didn't even know our Chief"
