#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#554 (mes)
- "had friends outside of Comodo."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#555 (mes)
- "[Razy]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#556 (mes)
- "You know, they kind of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#557 (mes)
- "strike me as old war buddies,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#558 (mes)
