+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#560 (mes)
- "the time. Then, there's those"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#561 (mes)
- "little scars they all have..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#562 (mes)
- "[BBQ Boy]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#563 (mes)
- "D-daddy! Is what those"
