#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#572 (mes)
- "How can that be true?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#573 (mes)
- "[BBQ Papa]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#574 (mes)
- "Now, now, don't tell"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#575 (mes)
- "me my little man is afraid"
