#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#576 (mes)
- "of something like a little"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#577 (mes)
- "witch. It's just an old fairy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#578 (mes)
- "tale, son: no reason to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#579 (mes)
- "feel frightened at all."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#580 (mes)
- "[BBQ Boy]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#581 (mes)
- "No, Daddy, I'm not"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#582 (mes)
- "scared! But if the witch"
