#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#585 (mes)
- "here in Comodo, right? I'm"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#586 (mes)
- "gonna go find it someday!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#587 (mes)
- "[BBQ Mama]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#588 (mes)
- "Oh, but I'm sure our"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#589 (mes)
- "Chief would already know"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#590 (mes)
- "something about that witch"
