#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#599 (mes)
- "all about her!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#600 (mes)
- "[Tausupa]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#601 (mes)
- "Maybe you can't tell because"
