- "illusion of an eternal night."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#606 (mes)
- "It's quite beautiful, really..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#607 (mes)
- "[Tausupa]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#608 (mes)
- "People come from all over"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#609 (mes)
