+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#611 (mes)
- "our unique little village."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#612 (mes)
- "We've become quite"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#613 (mes)
- "the tourist attraction~"
