- "ready for the testing~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1205 (mes)
- "[Nigirboran]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1206 (mes)
- "Good, you have returned--"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1207 (mes)
- "I'd expect nothing less of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1208 (mes)
- "a brave and daring adventurer."
+ ""
