+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1221 (mes)
- "[Nigirboran]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1222 (mes)
- "Hmm... Your body seems"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1223 (mes)
