- "[Nigirboran]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1344 (mes)
- "Oh... Hello there."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1345 (mes)
- "I guess you could say"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1346 (mes)
- "that I'm something of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1347 (mes)
- "a trainer here in Comodo."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1348 (mes)
- "My name is Nigirboran."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1349 (mes)
- "I know it's hard to say..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1350 (mes)
- "[Nigirboran]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1351 (mes)
- "If Hullaris hasn't sent"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1352 (mes)
- "you, then I don't think"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1353 (mes)
- "I can be of any real help"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1354 (mes)
- "for you. That seems to be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1355 (mes)
- "the case, so I'd appreciate"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1356 (mes)
- "it if you'd let me train..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1357 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1358 (mes)
- "Ah. Your body is surrounded"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1359 (mes)
- "by the glow of one that has"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1360 (mes)
- "eaten of the Awakening Stone."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1361 (mes)
- "That alone may prove your value"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1362 (mes)
- "as an adventurer, but are you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1363 (mes)
- "free from your selfish desires?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1364 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1365 (mes)
- "Even just the smallest"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1366 (mes)
- "taint of greed or jealousy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1367 (mes)
- "can prove to be a corruptive"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1368 (mes)
- "influence when power is not"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1369 (mes)
- "tempered by wisdom and a"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1370 (mes)
- "sense of true compassion."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1371 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1372 (mes)
- "Others like you have come"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1373 (mes)
- "before me in hopes of learning"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1374 (mes)
- "about the Slate of Muriniel and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1375 (mes)
- "eventually obtaining one of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1376 (mes)
- "three accursed blades. You are probably no different from them..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1377 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1378 (mes)
- "The Slate of Muriniel is an"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1379 (mes)
- "alchemic artifact that can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1380 (mes)
- "help one access unimaginable"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1381 (mes)
- "power, originally developed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1382 (mes)
- "by a master of alchemy that was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1383 (mes)
- "known as Rikaseh Sumarecon."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1384 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1385 (mes)
- "Sumarecon had two apprentices,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1386 (mes)
- "and after he had passed down the secrets of the Slate of Muriniel"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1387 (mes)
- "to only one of his proteges, his other protege killed him and the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1388 (mes)
- "other student out of jealousy."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1389 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1390 (mes)
- "Sumarecon's secrets were"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1391 (mes)
- "thought to be lost forever..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1392 (mes)
- "Fortunately, years later, an"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1393 (mes)
- "Alchemist named Kuprite found"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1394 (mes)
- "Sumarecon's secret documents"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1395 (mes)
- "containing his knowledge."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1396 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1397 (mes)
- "Kuprite then taught these"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1398 (mes)
- "secrets to a select group of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1399 (mes)
- "Alchemy students, one of which"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1400 (mes)
- "was my ancestor, Burukesaemu."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1401 (mes)
- "And so, because of my lineage,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1402 (mes)
- "I have learned those secrets."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1403 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1404 (mes)
- "If you wish for me to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1405 (mes)
- "reproduce the Slate of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1406 (mes)
- "Muriniel for you, then"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1407 (mes)
- "please bring me the items"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1408 (mes)
- "I require to complete the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1409 (mes)
- "secret alchemic procedure."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1410 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1411 (mes)
- "I shall need"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1412 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Sapphire^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1413 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Shining Stone^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1414 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Rough Elunium^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1415 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Emerald^000000, and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1416 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Blue Gemstone^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1417 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1418 (mes)
- "You've already found"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1419 (mes)
- "all of the items I require to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1420 (mes)
- "create the Slate of Muriniel?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1421 (mes)
- "Fantastic. Now I can begin work"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1422 (mes)
- "on this. However, there is one"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1423 (mes)
- "more thing I must ask of you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1424 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1425 (mes)
- "Would you please bring me"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1426 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Cobweb^000000? You can obtain"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1427 (mes)
- "them by slaying spiders in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1428 (mes)
- "Muriniel Pass which is on the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1429 (mes)
- "way to Al De Baran from here."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1430 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1431 (mes)
- "I'd have asked for it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1432 (mes)
- "sooner, but I need to prepare"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1433 (mes)
- "all of these stones, and I need"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1434 (mes)
- "the freshest Cobwebs I can get."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1435 (mes)
- "I'll make sure that these stones are ready when you return."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1436 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1437 (mes)
- "If you wish for me to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1438 (mes)
- "reproduce the Slate of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1439 (mes)
- "Muriniel for you, then"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1440 (mes)
- "please bring me the items"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1441 (mes)
- "I require to complete the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1442 (mes)
- "secret alchemic procedure."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1443 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1444 (mes)
- "I shall need"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1445 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Sapphire^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1446 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Shining Stone^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1447 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Rough Elunium^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1448 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Emerald^000000, and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1449 (mes)
- "^3355FF1 Blue Gemstone^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1450 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1451 (mes)
- "I see that you've brought"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1452 (mes)
- "me a Cobweb. It's hard to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1453 (mes)
- "believe, but it's integreal to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1454 (mes)
- "creating the Slate of Muriniel."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1455 (mes)
- "Now, if you'll wait a moment,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1456 (mes)
- "I shall complete the slate..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1457 (mes)
- "*^3355FFClang Clang Clang!*"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1458 (mes)
- "*Zaaaaaaaaaaaaaap*"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1459 (mes)
- "*Ching tink t-t-t-tap*^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1460 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1461 (mes)
- "*Whew* It's finished."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1462 (mes)
- "Please take care of this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1463 (mes)
- "slate, and know that I am"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1464 (mes)
- "entrusting you with an artifact"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1465 (mes)
- "that can help you access power"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1466 (mes)
- "beyond your imagination..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1467 (mes)
- "^3355FFYou have received"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1468 (mes)
- "the Slate of Muriniel.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1469 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1470 (mes)
- "There. You have eaten of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1471 (mes)
- "the Awakening Stone and you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1472 (mes)
- "possess the Slate of Muriniel."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1473 (mes)
- "Now, you must try to obtain the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1474 (mes)
- "^3355FFBook of the Lamb^000000 if you are"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1475 (mes)
- "questing for a doomed sword..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1476 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1477 (mes)
- "I know very little about"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1478 (mes)
- "that artifact, and its secrets"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1479 (mes)
- "are as well guarded as that of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1480 (mes)
- "the Slate of Muriniel. However,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1481 (mes)
- "I do know that a man in Morocc can create the Book of the Lamb..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1482 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1483 (mes)
- "If that man is still in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1484 (mes)
- "Morocc, then he will probably"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1485 (mes)
- "recognize the subtle emanation"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1486 (mes)
- "of the Awakening Stone and the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1487 (mes)
- "Slate of Muriniel from you. Best of luck to you, adventurer..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1488 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1489 (mes)
- "Ah, have you brought a"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1490 (mes)
- "Cobweb? I know it sounds"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1491 (mes)
- "strange, but I really need the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1492 (mes)
- "unique energy found only in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1493 (mes)
- "fresh Cobwebs to finish the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1494 (mes)
- "Slate of Muriniel for you..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1495 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1496 (mes)
- "You've eaten of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1497 (mes)
- "Awakening Stone and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1498 (mes)
- "now possess the Slate of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1499 (mes)
- "Muriniel. Now, all you must"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1500 (mes)
- "do is obtain the Book of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1501 (mes)
- "Lamb. I know little about it..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1502 (mes)
- "[Meteurengut]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1503 (mes)
- "All I can tell you is that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1504 (mes)
- "there should be a man in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1505 (mes)
- "Morocc that can create it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1506 (mes)
- "for you. A man like that can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1507 (mes)
- "sense the Slate of Muriniel,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_comodo.txt#1508 (mes)
