#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#904 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#905 (mes)
- "So you wanted to talk to me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#906 (mes)
- "I'm pretty tired right now, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#907 (mes)
- "I can spare a moment or two."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#908 (mes)
- "What would you like to ask?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#909 (select)
- "Ask About Veins Smugglers:Ask About Zhed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#910 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#911 (mes)
- "Veins smugglers..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#912 (mes)
- "Would you explain"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#913 (mes)
- "exactly what you mean"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#914 (mes)
- "by Veins smugglers?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#915 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#916 (mes)
- "Oh, them. Yes, I know"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#917 (mes)
- "a little bit about them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#918 (mes)
- "I'm afraid that I can't really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#919 (mes)
- "disclose certain information"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#920 (mes)
- "about them since they're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#921 (mes)
- "a classified case..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#922 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#923 (mes)
- "I'm afraid that I cannot give you information about them easily"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#924 (mes)
- "as they mean a lot to us."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#925 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#926 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#927 (mes)
- "Actually, I was curious"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#928 (mes)
- "about who they kidnapped."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#929 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#930 (mes)
- "Oh, well, I suppose"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#931 (mes)
- "I can tell you more"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#932 (mes)
- "about their captive."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#933 (mes)
- "But first, I'd like to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#934 (mes)
- "ask you for a favor."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#935 (select)
- "Accept:Do Not Refuse"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#936 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#937 (mes)
- "When we realized the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#938 (mes)
- "kind of hostage the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#939 (mes)
- "smugglers captured, we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#940 (mes)
- "didn't know what to do with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#941 (mes)
- "him. We've had too many"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#942 (mes)
- "internal problems to handle..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#943 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#944 (mes)
- "Still, we felt that we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#945 (mes)
- "could use him in our plan,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#946 (mes)
- "so we held him in a secret"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#947 (mes)
- "place whose location is only"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#948 (mes)
- "known to a few people. But"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#949 (mes)
- "then... We lost all contact."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#950 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#951 (mes)
- "We sent investigators, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#952 (mes)
- "we still have no idea what"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#953 (mes)
- "happened. All they found was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#954 (mes)
- "a message left by one survivor:"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#955 (mes)
- "''They're all demons.'' The"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#956 (mes)
- "hostage is probably dead."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#957 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#958 (mes)
- "He may have been a high"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#959 (mes)
- "ranking official, but we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#960 (mes)
- "were too preoccupied"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#961 (mes)
- "with other matters. In fact,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#962 (mes)
- "I haven't gotten the chance"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#963 (mes)
- "to think of what to do with him..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#964 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#965 (mes)
- "I want to ask you to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#966 (mes)
- "go to that place, and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#967 (mes)
- "figure out what happened"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#968 (mes)
- "there, and if that high ranking"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#969 (mes)
- "official from Rune-Midgarts is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#970 (mes)
- "still alive. I doubt it, but..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#971 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#972 (mes)
- "The investigators we employ"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#973 (mes)
- "in our temple usually pale"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#974 (mes)
- "in comparison to you foreign"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#975 (mes)
- "adventurers, so I have faith"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#976 (mes)
- "that you can do it. Still,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#977 (mes)
- "it'll be quite dangerous."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#978 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#979 (mes)
- "If you can do this, I'll"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#980 (mes)
- "tell you the location of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#981 (mes)
- "that place: we usually call"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#982 (mes)
- "it the monastery. It used to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#983 (mes)
- "be an actual monastery, but we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#984 (mes)
- "use it to hold captives now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#985 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#986 (mes)
- "I'm sorry, but I can't tell"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#987 (mes)
- "you anything else about that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#988 (mes)
- "old place. It's located to the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#989 (mes)
- "southwest of Veins across the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#990 (mes)
- "sea. You should be able to find"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#991 (mes)
- "a boat at South Veins Beach."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#992 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#993 (mes)
- "However... Never mind."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#994 (mes)
- "I'd like to help you more,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#995 (mes)
- "but I'd be compromising my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#996 (mes)
- "position. I'm sorry. Please"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#997 (mes)
- "come back and tell me if"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#998 (mes)
- "you learn anything there."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#999 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1000 (mes)
- "I'll send a message to the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1001 (mes)
- "magistrate of Veins. If you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1002 (mes)
- "talk to him, he'll provide you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1003 (mes)
- "with some useful information"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1004 (mes)
- "for your journey. Good luck."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1005 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1006 (mes)
- "Going to the monastery"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1007 (mes)
- "isn't the problem: coming"
