#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1009 (mes)
- "be the real challenge for you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1010 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1011 (mes)
- "We can't send any troops"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1012 (mes)
- "there until we understand"
