#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1013 (mes)
- "what they'd be confronting"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1014 (mes)
- "there. That's why we need"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1015 (mes)
- "you to investigate the area."
+ ""
