#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1023 (mes)
- "Still investigating the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1024 (mes)
- "monastery? Perhaps if"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1025 (mes)
- "you found any records"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1026 (mes)
- "left behind by one of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1027 (mes)
- "the residents over there..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1028 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1029 (mes)
- "You found this journal"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1030 (mes)
- "in the monastery? Perfect."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1031 (mes)
- "Let me read it, and see"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1032 (mes)
- "what we can learn..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1033 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1034 (mes)
- "Hmm, this sounds really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1035 (mes)
- "bad. This is tragic, especially"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1036 (mes)
- "we kept so many important"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1037 (mes)
- "people over there. I'll request"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1038 (mes)
- "to dispatch troops there right"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1039 (mes)
- "away. Something must be done."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1040 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1041 (mes)
- "There are too many problems"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1042 (mes)
- "we have to confront now, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1043 (mes)
- "this monastery issue needs"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1044 (mes)
- "top priority. We won't be able"
