#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1045 (mes)
- "to handle it if another threat"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1046 (mes)
- "comes from that place."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1047 (mes)
- "[Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1048 (mes)
- "I suppose that Arunafeltz"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1049 (mes)
- "and Rune-Midgarts will be too"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1050 (mes)
- "busy with their own internal"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1051 (mes)
- "issues to commit to war."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1052 (mes)
- "High Priest Zhed will be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1053 (mes)
- "glad to know about this."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1054 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1055 (mes)
- "I'm sorry..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1056 (mes)
- "I really don't want"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1057 (mes)
- "to think about Zhed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1058 (mes)
- "right now. He's just..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1059 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1060 (mes)
- "You wanted to ask me about"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1061 (mes)
- "Beken--High Priest Zhed?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1062 (mes)
- "I can't do anything for him."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1063 (mes)
- "He dug his own grave by"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1064 (mes)
- "allowing you into the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1065 (mes)
- "holy ground, didn't he?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1066 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1067 (mes)
- "I thought I warned you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1068 (mes)
- "before to stay out of trouble."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1069 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1070 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1071 (mes)
- "I'm not here to discuss"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1072 (mes)
- "that. But I happened to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1073 (mes)
- "hear that you're the only"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1074 (mes)
- "person that can help him now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1075 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1076 (mes)
- "..............................."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1077 (mes)
- "..............................."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1078 (mes)
- "..............................."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1079 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1080 (mes)
- "It's true that Zhed and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1081 (mes)
- "I used to work well together,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1082 (mes)
- "but we no longer share the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1083 (mes)
- "same dream. You'd better find"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1084 (mes)
- "someone else. Unlike him,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1085 (mes)
- "I actually want a war."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1086 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1087 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1088 (mes)
- "Weren't you guys friends?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1089 (mes)
- "Besides, you don't seem as"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1090 (mes)
- "aggressive as those other"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1091 (mes)
- "hard liner priests."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1092 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1093 (mes)
- "Aggressive? Hmpf. If you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1094 (mes)
- "take a good look at those"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1095 (mes)
- "moderates, you'll see that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1096 (mes)
- "they oppose war, but they're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1097 (mes)
- "also totally corrupt. In fact, they committed worse atrocities!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1098 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1099 (mes)
- "The moderates conducted"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1100 (mes)
- "inhumane testing on living"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1101 (mes)
- "creatures, even humans!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1102 (mes)
- "And Zhed and I... Could do"
