#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1111 (mes)
- "Priestess Niren's mind."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1112 (mes)
- "For now, you'd better talk"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1113 (mes)
- "to High Priest Zhed.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1114 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1115 (mes)
- "I already told you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1116 (mes)
- "how I feel about Zhed."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1117 (mes)
- "We were wrong all along..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1118 (mes)
- "This time, war is the answer."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1119 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1120 (mes)
- "I already told you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1121 (mes)
- "how I feel about Zhed."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1122 (mes)
- "We were wrong all along..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1123 (mes)
- "This time, war is the answer."
