#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1300 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1301 (mes)
- "I administered a blessing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1302 (mes)
- "for a child from a native"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1303 (mes)
