#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1306 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1307 (mes)
- "It turns out that this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1308 (mes)
