- "^3355FFYou handed Niren the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1329 (mes)
- "file forged by Ishmael.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1330 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1331 (mes)
- "Perfect! This forgery is"
