+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1383 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1384 (mes)
- "Our priests may have acted"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1385 (mes)
- "selfishly, but they are still"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1386 (mes)
- "committed to Arunafeltz's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1387 (mes)
- "welfare. Things should"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1388 (mes)
- "change for the better now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1389 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1390 (mes)
- "I'm ashamed that I strayed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1391 (mes)
- "from the path of peace and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1392 (mes)
- "almost endangered my country."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1393 (mes)
- "I'm glad Zhed brought me back"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1394 (mes)
- "my senses. From now on, I'll"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1395 (mes)
- "repent for my sins with Zhed."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1396 (mes)
- "[High Priestess Niren]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1397 (mes)
- "I hope the goddess can"
