- "[Sippie]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1418 (mes)
- "Now I finally have some"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1419 (mes)
- "time to take a break."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#1420 (mes)
- "Too many followers are"
