#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3059 (mes)
- "[Dorian]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3060 (mes)
- "It sounds like you're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3061 (mes)
- "done fixing my Mystic"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3062 (mes)
- "Dryer de Elegance."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3063 (mes)
- "Why don't you come"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3064 (mes)
- "back so I can explain"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3065 (mes)
- "how you can use it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3066 (mes)
- "^3355FFYou lift the main"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3067 (mes)
- "operational switch,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3068 (mes)
- "turning on a light and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3069 (mes)
- "opening a convenient"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3070 (mes)
- "slot. You insert the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3071 (mes)
- "wet bond of debt.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3072 (mes)
- "^3355FFThe engine's pistons"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3073 (mes)
- "and cylinders churn"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3074 (mes)
- "with a lively din, and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3075 (mes)
- "when the heater stops,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3076 (mes)
- "the slot reopens.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3077 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3078 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3079 (mes)
- "So this is the original"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3080 (mes)
- "bond of debt that Muff"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3081 (mes)
- "lost? It looks... Perfect!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3082 (mes)
- "You already used this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3083 (mes)
- "machine to restore the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3084 (mes)
- "bond of debt. There's no"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3085 (mes)
- "need to mess around"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3086 (mes)
- "with it any longer."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3087 (mes)
- "[Dorian]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3088 (mes)
- "Who are you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3089 (mes)
- "Don't you dare lay"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3090 (mes)
- "a hand on my precious"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3091 (mes)
- "masterpiece inventions! "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3092 (mes)
- "[Ibrahim]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3093 (mes)
- "You're carrying too much"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3094 (mes)
- "stuff with you. Dump it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3095 (mes)
- "in Kafra Storge, sell it,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3096 (mes)
- "drop it, whatever, before"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3097 (mes)
- "you come talk to me, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3098 (mes)
- "[Ibrahim]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3099 (mes)
- "Have you heard of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3100 (mes)
- "Four Cursed Jewels?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3101 (mes)
- "I hear that one of them,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3102 (mes)
- "the Diamond of Destruction,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3103 (mes)
- "just appeared recently."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3104 (mes)
- "What I'd do to find it..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3105 (mes)
- "[Ibrahim]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3107 (mes)
- ", right?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3108 (mes)
- "Don't be too suprised."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3109 (mes)
- "I've heard of you here"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3110 (mes)
- "and there. Heh heh~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3111 (select)
- "How can I help you?:What'd you hear?:Bye!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3112 (mes)
- "[Ibrahim]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3113 (mes)
- "I wanted to ask you about"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3114 (mes)
- "the Four Cursed Jewels."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3115 (mes)
- "All the merchants in the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3116 (mes)
- "area are talking about them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3117 (mes)
- "Anyway, I was able to obtain"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3118 (mes)
- "the Diamond of Destruction!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3119 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3120 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3121 (mes)
- "(^666666Hmm... He might"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3122 (mes)
- "be talking about that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3123 (mes)
- "jewel Muff gave to Belder"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3124 (mes)
- "as collateral for his debt.^000000)"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3125 (mes)
- "[Ibrahim]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3126 (mes)
- "I paid a hefty sum for it,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3127 (mes)
- "but then I lost it after"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3128 (mes)
- "just a few days. I kept it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3129 (mes)
- "under high security, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3130 (mes)
- "that didn't stop the thief..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3131 (mes)
- "[Ibrahim]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3132 (mes)
- "It's a risky job, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3133 (mes)
- "I want to employ you to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3134 (mes)
- "find where my diamond went."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3135 (mes)
- "It'd be best if you could get"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3136 (mes)
- "it back, but I can understand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3137 (mes)
- "if you can't. You up for it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3138 (select)
- "Sure, I'll help you.:No, sorry."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3139 (mes)
- "[Ibrahim]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3140 (mes)
- "Great! I knew it was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3141 (mes)
- "a good idea to find you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3142 (mes)
- "The thief didn't leave any"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3143 (mes)
- "clues, but he should have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3144 (mes)
- "some problems selling the gem."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3145 (mes)
- "It's one of a kind, you know."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3146 (mes)
- "[Ibrahim]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3147 (mes)
- "Visiting the large"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3148 (mes)
- "jewelry shops in the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3149 (mes)
- "Rune-Midgarts Kingdom"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3150 (mes)
- "would be a good start."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3151 (mes)
- "Their merchants know the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3152 (mes)
- "most about those jewels."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3153 (mes)
- "[Ibrahim]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3154 (mes)
- "The thief will also have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3155 (mes)
- "to sell the jewel to a jeweler"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3156 (mes)
