- "[Jhonnita]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3539 (mes)
- "...........................Um."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3540 (mes)
- "It's an incredibly nice"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3541 (mes)
- "emerald, but I can't take"
