- "[Jhonnita]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3548 (mes)
- "J-just get out of my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3549 (mes)
- "shop! Go... Go to Payon"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3550 (mes)
- "and talk to Kimeunbang!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3551 (mes)
- "Y-yeah, and don't come back!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3552 (mes)
- "[Jhonnita]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3553 (mes)
- "What'd I tell you, huh?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3554 (mes)
- "I don't want you here"
