#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3568 (mes)
- "already? Go away!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3569 (mes)
- "[Jhonnita]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3570 (mes)
- "Are you here to buy or"
