#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3584 (mes)
- "I was so close to getting"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3585 (mes)
- "that Diamond of Destruction."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3586 (mes)
- "So close! Belder, my business"
