#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3589 (mes)
- "[Kimeunbang]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3590 (mes)
- "Somehow, Belder ended up"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3591 (mes)
