#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3596 (mes)
- "[Kimeunbang]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3597 (mes)
- "This was a monumental"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#3598 (mes)
- "failure. I haven't been"
