- "National Wanted Notice:Z Gang:What crimes did Z Gang commit?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4417 (mes)
- "[Chief Officer]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4418 (mes)
- "Ah, were you interested"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4419 (mes)
- "in pursuing the Z Gang?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4420 (mes)
- "Please carefully read the"
