- "a knight named Valdes."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4429 (mes)
- "He's fairly familiar with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4430 (mes)
- "their brand of antics."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4431 (mes)
- "[Chief Officer]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4432 (mes)
- "Unfortunately, I fear"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4433 (mes)
- "that he may be ashamed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4434 (mes)
- "of his failure to catch"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4435 (mes)
- "them. However, I am sure"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4436 (mes)
- "that he will be of service"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4437 (mes)
- "in your quest for justice."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4438 (mes)
- "[Chief Officer]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4439 (mes)
- "You wanted to know more"
