#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4443 (mes)
- "little I've heard."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4444 (select)
- "Louis:Martha:Catfoii:Book of Forbidden Mystery?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4445 (mes)
- "[Chief Officer]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#4446 (mes)
- "Louis Von Silokens was"
