+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6871 (mes)
- "Let's see, where did I put all"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6872 (mes)
- "of my notes about that?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6873 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6874 (mes)
- "Would you mind coming"
