+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6877 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6878 (mes)
- "Ah, let's see now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6879 (mes)
- "There's a record here"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6880 (mes)
- "entitled, ''The Story of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6881 (mes)
