+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6882 (mes)
- "to this, no one knows where"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6883 (mes)
- "these jewels were first found."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6884 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6885 (mes)
- "The first incident involving"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6886 (mes)
- "the jewel involved a Comodo"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6887 (mes)
- "resident that used the jewel"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6888 (mes)
- "to pay a gambling debt. He"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6889 (mes)
- "committed suicide after he"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6890 (mes)
- "paid his debt, which is a pity."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6891 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6892 (mes)
- "He didn't tell anyone"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6893 (mes)
- "where he found the jewel"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6894 (mes)
- "before he died, so we have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6895 (mes)
- "no way of determining the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6896 (mes)
- "jewel's true origins."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6897 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6898 (mes)
- "After it was sold, the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6899 (mes)
- "jewel came into a rich man's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6900 (mes)
- "possession. However, he lost"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6901 (mes)
- "his fortune and was completely"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6902 (mes)
- "ruined after obtaining it. Hence the moniker, ''Unlucky Emerald.''"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6903 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6904 (mes)
- "Then the emerald came into"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6905 (mes)
- "the hands of a noble lady"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6906 (mes)
- "who mysteriously died at"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6907 (mes)
- "a young age. The emerald's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6908 (mes)
- "had thousands of owners"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6909 (mes)
- "who just... Died."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6910 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6911 (mes)
- "What's disturbing is that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6912 (mes)
- "the emerald's curse seems"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6913 (mes)
- "to grow stronger with each"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6914 (mes)
