+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6915 (mes)
- "your jewel perfectly matches"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6916 (mes)
- "the descriptions, so, uh..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6917 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6918 (mes)
- "You are the new owner"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6919 (mes)
- "of the Unlucky Emerald."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6920 (mes)
