+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6921 (mes)
- "you while it's still cursed."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6922 (mes)
- "For the sake of your life,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6923 (mes)
- "you must break that curse."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6924 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6925 (mes)
- "Now, holy spells won't work"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6926 (mes)
- "on this kind of curse. You'll"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6927 (mes)
- "need to talk to a shaman."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6928 (mes)
- "I think he lives in... Alberta?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6929 (mes)
