+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6935 (mes)
- "And I'm sure he'll be pretty"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6936 (mes)
- "excited to see that you have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6937 (mes)
