+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6947 (mes)
- "some warrior? Interesting..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6948 (mes)
- "I should record this in my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6949 (mes)
- "research notes. Thank you!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6950 (mes)
- "[Scholar]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6951 (mes)
- "Some jewels are said to"
