+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6956 (mes)
- "insanity, that sort of thing."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6957 (mes)
- "[Shaman]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#6958 (mes)
