#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7136 (mes)
- "specific jewel. Hopefully,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7137 (mes)
- "he will have the answer."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7138 (mes)
- "[Shaman]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7139 (mes)
- "For now, the jewel's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7140 (mes)
- "curse is beyond my power."
