+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7430 (mes)
- "your age when it happened..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7431 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7432 (mes)
- "We received a report about"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7433 (mes)
