- "battle was over once we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7437 (mes)
- "arrived. We were too late."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7438 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7439 (mes)
- "All the Cobolds were slain,"
+ ""
