+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7445 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7446 (mes)
- "We had no choice but to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7447 (mes)
- "kill him. It was self defense,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7448 (mes)
- "but I can't help but pity him."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7449 (mes)
- "All his comrades had been"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7450 (mes)
- "killed: I can't imagine how"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7451 (mes)
- "that must have felt."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7452 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7453 (mes)
- "We arrived too late to"
