#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7454 (mes)
- "see that battle, but I'm"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7455 (mes)
- "pretty sure it was horrific."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7456 (mes)
- "You must be pretty interested"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7457 (mes)
- "in learning about this soldier."
