#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7458 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7459 (mes)
- "Well, I'm just glad that you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7460 (mes)
