#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7464 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7465 (mes)
- "I don't regret that we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7466 (mes)
- "had to kill that warrior."
