#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7468 (mes)
- "back in those days."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7469 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7470 (mes)
- "Oh, it's you again."
