#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7475 (select)
- "Sorry...:I met the warrior's spirit."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7476 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7477 (mes)
- "It's fine."
+ ""
