#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7484 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7485 (mes)
- "That's quite a story."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7486 (mes)
- "Still, I'm surprised that"
