#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7496 (select)
- "I feel so sorry for him.:Do you believe the jewel is really cursed?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7497 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7498 (mes)
- "Well..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7499 (mes)
- "I don't know what to tell"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7500 (mes)
- "you. I mean, you can't really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7501 (mes)
- "put the blame on anybody."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7502 (mes)
- "He just lost his mind..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7503 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7504 (mes)
- "I'm not really sure if the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7505 (mes)
- "jewel was cursed, if that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7506 (mes)
- "warrior started the curse,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7507 (mes)
- "or if the jewel isn't cursed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7508 (mes)
- "at all. I'm just an old,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7509 (mes)
- "simple soldier."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7510 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7511 (mes)
- "One thing's for sure:"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7512 (mes)
- "if there was a curse, that"
