#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7514 (mes)
- "able to overcome it if his will"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7515 (mes)
- "was strong enough. It's harsh"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7516 (mes)
- "to say it like this, but..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7517 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7518 (mes)
- "True warriors have the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7519 (mes)
- "strength to endure, to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7520 (mes)
- "fight temptation, to keep"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7521 (mes)
- "their focus. That guy..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7522 (mes)
- "He wasn't cut out to fight."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7523 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7524 (mes)
- "You know what?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7525 (mes)
- "If you're so worried"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7526 (mes)
- "about a curse, why don't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7527 (mes)
- "you leave that jewel with me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7528 (mes)
- "Don't worry, I'll make sure"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7529 (mes)
- "to compensate you for it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7530 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7531 (mes)
- "I'd rather keep it to myself,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7532 (mes)
- "rather than risk it messing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7533 (mes)
- "around with other people."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7534 (mes)
- "I know my will's tough enough"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7535 (mes)
- "to resist its curse, you know,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7536 (mes)
- "if it actually exists."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7537 (mes)
- "[Retired Soldier]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7538 (mes)
- "If there's anything"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/quests_nameless.txt#7539 (mes)
