#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#9 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#10 (mes)
- "I'm the only human on earth"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#11 (mes)
- "blessed with the ability to create Gleipnir. Aside from the Dwarves, I'm the only person that can make this item!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#12 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#13 (mes)
- "There you go!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#14 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#15 (mes)
- "Gleipnir is said to be so strong that not even the Fenrir Wolf could break it! I take great pride in being able to create this!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#16 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#17 (mes)
- "We are Crusaders that have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#18 (mes)
- "been training in preparation"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#19 (mes)
- "for the Holy War that is to come."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#20 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#21 (mes)
- "As our forefathers have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#22 (mes)
- "done a thousand years ago, we shall vanquish the hordes of Demons when the day comes."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#23 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#24 (mes)
- "If you have any questions about Crusaders, feel free to ask me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#25 (mes)
- "I may be too old and weak for fighting, but I will spread our message as much as I can."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#26 (select)
- "What is Holy Cross?:What is Grand Cross?:What is Sacrifice?:What is Gleipnir?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#27 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#28 (mes)
- "Holy Cross is the first manifestation of a Crusader's faith. By making the sign of the cross, Crusader's can inflict a holy attack on their enemies."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#29 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#30 (mes)
- "Monsters that are weak against holiness, particularly the Undead, will be blinded by the light of the Holy Cross. All they can do is wait for holy judgment."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#31 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#32 (mes)
- "Based on our latest research,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#33 (mes)
- "the Holy Cross can inflict 4.5 times more damage than a normal attack once it is mastered."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#34 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#35 (mes)
- "Grand Cross...!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#36 (mes)
- "The righteous fury of God is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#37 (mes)
- "given form in this destructive skill."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#38 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#39 (mes)
- "God grants us his power so that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#40 (mes)
- "we may punish the forces of evil, and one's rage is embodied in a giant crucifix of power."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#41 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#42 (mes)
- "The power of the crucifix of light can damage the enemy three times. Each strike will have five times the strength of your normal attacks."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#43 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#44 (mes)
- "However, when Crusaders use Grand Cross, they must exercise extreme caution. The human body is too weak to fully embrace the will of God."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#45 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#46 (mes)
- "Therefore, using this skill, will cause the Crusader to suffer from damage. However, this damage can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#47 (mes)
- "be reduced to half with Faith."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#48 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#49 (mes)
- "In practicing what we preach, Crusaders choose to protect"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#50 (mes)
- "others by bearing the suffering of their fellow man."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#51 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#52 (mes)
- "The Sacrifice skill allows Crusaders to keep their comrades safe from harm by receiving the damage that was intended for them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#53 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#54 (mes)
- "It is the greatest demonstration of faith,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#55 (mes)
- "as well as of love for your comrades. Such an attitude is essential for a servant of God!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#56 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#57 (mes)
- "However, if the people you want to protect stray away from you, you cannot use the Sacrifice skill for them unless they are close to you again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#58 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#59 (mes)
- "As you visualize the suffering of those you want to protect, you'll never hesitate to sacrifice yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#60 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#61 (mes)
- "Thank you, God, for granting me with the power to protect my people."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#62 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#63 (mes)
- "Gleipnir is the essence of Megingjard which I have been researching."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#64 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#65 (mes)
- "It's the only binding strong enough that will allow a human to wear Megingjard around his waist."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#66 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#67 (mes)
- "Although I can no longer fight, I've been studying how to create Gleipnir for years. I will be more than willing to create it for you if you can bring me..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#68 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#69 (mes)
- "^0000FF4 Cat Tread^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#70 (mes)
- "^0000FF5 Woman's Moustache^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#71 (mes)
- "^0000FF4 Root of Stone^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#72 (mes)
- "^0000FF3 Sputum of Bird^000000 and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#73 (mes)
- "^0000FF3 Sinew of Bear^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#74 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#75 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#76 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#77 (mes)
- "Why are you wandering"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#78 (mes)
- "around this sacred place?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#79 (mes)
- "Do you not understand that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#80 (mes)
- "we must prepare for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#81 (mes)
- "the Holy War?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#82 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#83 (mes)
- "No matter how much I explain, the ignorant never fully understand the importance of our task. The balance of power will shift when we least expect it!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#84 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#85 (mes)
- "I wish I could go back"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#86 (mes)
- "to those times when I would"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#87 (mes)
- "train Crusaders, rather than"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#88 (mes)
- "preach to the ignorant."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#89 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#90 (mes)
- "I miss my Crusaders who"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#91 (mes)
- "were enthusiastic to listen to what I had to say, and carried out their orders with loyalty."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#92 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#93 (mes)
- "I am wonder"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#94 (mes)
- "where they have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#95 (mes)
- "all gone now..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#96 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#97 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#98 (mes)
- "......"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#99 (mes)
- "........."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#100 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#101 (mes)
- "Adventurer, if you have the time to listen to me speak to myself, why don't you perform a task for me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#102 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#103 (mes)
- "It may be an enriching"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#104 (mes)
- "experience for you. It's possible that you'll even have a greater appreciation for Crusaders."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#105 (select)
- "What is it?:I'm sick and tired of doin' favors."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#106 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#107 (mes)
- "I want you to find the members of the 1st Squad in the 3rd Platoon of the 3rd Company. If you happen to encounter them in your travels, please ask them how they are doing."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#108 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#109 (mes)
- "It shouldn't be that difficult to do and won't be a waste of your time if you are already planning"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#110 (mes)
- "to explore the world."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#111 (select)
- "Sure, why not.:I'm sorry, but no."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#112 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#113 (mes)
- "Excellent!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#114 (mes)
- "All I want you to do is find my old comrades, and inform me of how"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#115 (mes)
- "they are doing."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#116 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#117 (mes)
- "However..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#118 (mes)
- "There is one problem."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#119 (mes)
- "I don't where they are."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#120 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#121 (mes)
- "You could try to find a record of residency changes by citizens of the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#122 (mes)
- "the Prontera Library..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#123 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#124 (mes)
- "However, the records of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#125 (mes)
- "Crusader personnel is considered confidential, so I am not sure of whether or not you can view them."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#126 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#127 (mes)
- "You must understand, my position requires me to remain in this area 24 hours, 7 days a week. I cannot leave without the consent of the upper hierarchy."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#128 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#129 (mes)
- "However, I know you have the freedom and the time to go wherever you please. I'd appreciate if you would do this for me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#130 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#131 (mes)
- "My old comrades in arms."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#132 (mes)
- "You have no idea how much"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#133 (mes)
- "I miss them..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#134 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#135 (mes)
- "^333333*Sigh...*^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#136 (mes)
- "Please understand that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#137 (mes)
- "I would not be asking this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#138 (mes)
- "of you if it were not for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#139 (mes)
- "the restraints of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#140 (mes)
- "my position."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#141 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#142 (mes)
- "I have an obligation to this Kingdom to keep my post and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#143 (mes)
- "inform adventurers about the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#144 (mes)
- "Crusader class. Because of this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#145 (mes)
- "awesome responsibility, I must"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#146 (mes)
- "remain here, ever vigilant."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#147 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#148 (mes)
- "If you can't understand, then you must be taking your freedom for granted..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#149 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#150 (mes)
- "As far as I remember, this is the first time I have asked you to do me a favor."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#151 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#152 (mes)
- "Unlike you, I know the meaning"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#153 (mes)
- "of responsibility. I remain here, helping inquisitive adventurers for the sake of King and country."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#154 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#155 (mes)
- "Still..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#156 (mes)
- "Know this."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#157 (mes)
- "Although the results may not be immediate, you will always be rewarded when you help others."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#158 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#159 (mes)
- "Please reconsider"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#160 (mes)
- "when you get the chance."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#161 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#162 (mes)
- "I wonder how my old"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#163 (mes)
- "comrades are doing now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#164 (mes)
- "I can't even remember"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#165 (mes)
- "the last time I saw them..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#166 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#167 (mes)
- "Hmm...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#168 (mes)
- "Haven't you left"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#169 (mes)
- "to search for them yet?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#170 (select)
- "Where should I go?:I am about to leave.:What do you mean by final mission?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#171 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#172 (mes)
- "Well..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#173 (mes)
- "You should be able"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#174 (mes)
- "find some clue as to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#175 (mes)
- "where to find them through"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#176 (mes)
- "^0000FFThe Platoon Records^000000 in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#177 (mes)
- "the Prontera Library."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#178 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#179 (mes)
- "Oh, you are..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#180 (mes)
- "I wonder what they"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#181 (mes)
- "have been doing since"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#182 (mes)
- "our ^0000FFfinal mission^000000..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#183 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#184 (mes)
- "Final mission...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#185 (mes)
- "Well, I can't recall"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#186 (mes)
- "everything at the moment,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#187 (mes)
- "but it was the reason why"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#188 (mes)
- "our squad broke up."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#189 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#190 (mes)
- "We were a great team."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#191 (mes)
- "But in the military system,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#192 (mes)
- "you need to follow the orders"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#193 (mes)
- "of your superiors..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#194 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#195 (mes)
- "If only..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#196 (mes)
- "^660000He^000000 hadn't interfered..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#197 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#198 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#199 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#200 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#201 (mes)
- "......"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#202 (mes)
