#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#266 (mes)
- "If it's possible, I hope you can meet the rest of the 1st Squad face to face, so I can know for sure that they're all alright."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#267 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#268 (mes)
- "A man's life is too"
