- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#290 (mes)
- "I appreciate that you've delivered news of my old comrades to me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#291 (mes)
