#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#295 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#296 (mes)
- "Great!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#297 (mes)
- "I'm glad to hear"
