#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#311 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#312 (mes)
- "Don't you get it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#313 (mes)
- "The elite and powerful rule this world. I am untouchable! And the weak and the lowly can rot in hell! Heh heh!"
