#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#327 (mes)
- "you'd actually do it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#328 (mes)
- "But you'll be sorry later..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#329 (mes)
- "[Rebarev Doug]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#330 (mes)
- "Don't you get it?"
