+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#588 (mes)
- "Did you find it yet? All this time, and I still haven't been able to dig up that file."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#589 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#590 (mes)
- "I'll go ahead and check the left side, so would you look for it in the middle or the right side?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#591 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#592 (mes)
- "Ah! There it is!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#593 (mes)
- "Thank you so much!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#594 (mes)
- "I'm glad to see that there are still kind and thoughtful people like you in the world."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#595 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#596 (mes)
- "I really want to give you something to show you my gratitude, but I've got to send this back to the Prontera Military right away."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#597 (select)
- "I want to read the document."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#598 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#599 (mes)
- "Oh, right, you mentioned that, didn't you? It doesn't seem seem"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#600 (mes)
- "so important, but I'm not really quite sure..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#601 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#602 (mes)
- "Well, it couldn't hurt if I made a copy of this first for you to read, but I'll need some materials."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#603 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#604 (mes)
- "I'll even cast the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#605 (mes)
- "Search Magic on it, so that it'll be just like the original. All right, I need the following things to make a copy..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#606 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#607 (mes)
- "2 Slick Paper,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#608 (mes)
- "1 Oil Paper,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#609 (mes)
- "3 Squid Ink,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#610 (mes)
- "3 Feather of Birds and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#611 (mes)
- "20 Blue Gemstones."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#612 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#613 (mes)
- "Please get those as soon as possible, and I'll be here making the other preparations to make a copy."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#614 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#615 (mes)
- "Also, I'll keep this copy in the Library for you to read, and to prevent it from being leaked to the public. So you'll have to come visit each time you wish to read it, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#616 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#617 (mes)
- "Okay, now..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#618 (mes)
- "Come back here"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#619 (mes)
- "as soon as you can."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#620 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#621 (mes)
- "Oh, you came back."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#622 (mes)
- "I didn't expect you to return here so quickly. Whatever's inside must be really important for you to know."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#623 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#624 (mes)
- "Anyway, please"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#625 (mes)
- "give me a moment"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#626 (mes)
- "while I make that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#627 (mes)
- "copy for you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#628 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#629 (mes)
- "Alright then..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#630 (mes)
- "I'll see you in a bit."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#631 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#632 (mes)
- "Have you forgotten"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#633 (mes)
- "what you need to make"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#634 (mes)
- "a copy? Alright, let me"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#635 (mes)
- "tell you again..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#636 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#637 (mes)
- "2 Slick Paper,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#638 (mes)
- "1 Oil Paper,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#639 (mes)
- "3 Squid Ink,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#640 (mes)
- "3 Feather of Birds and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#641 (mes)
- "20 Blue Gemstones."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#642 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#643 (mes)
- "Please come"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#644 (mes)
- "back with those items"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#645 (mes)
- "as soon as you can."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#646 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#647 (mes)
- "Let me go over and review the document before I make a copy..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#648 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#649 (mes)
- "Let me go over and review the document before I make a copy..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#650 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#651 (mes)
- "There you go. As I thought, the document didn't seem to contain any crucially important data."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#652 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#653 (mes)
- "Just remember, this copy needs to stay in the Prontera Library. That means you have to come back if you need to read the document again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#654 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#655 (mes)
- "Welcome, my friend!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#656 (mes)
- "So, what do you need today?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#657 (select)
- "Record Search.:Quit searching.:Search Help:Converse."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#658 (mes)
- "^663300- Search Magic Initiated -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#659 (mes)
- "- Please enter a keyword. -"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#661 (mes)
- "*Search Magic is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#662 (mes)
- " case sensitive."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#663 (mes)
- "Please do not use"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#664 (mes)
- "capital letters.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#666 (mes)
- "^663300[Keyword: ^996633Crusader^663300]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#667 (mes)
- "Crusaders are warriors preparing for the upcoming Holy War against Evil. Experienced swordsmen, usually with remarkable spiritual prowess.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#669 (mes)
- "^663300[Keyword: ^9966333rd Company^663300]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#670 (mes)
- "Only the best Crusaders are selected to form the ranks of all squads in the 3rd Company. Most transfer records for 3rd Company Squads are unavailable.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#671 (mes)
- "^663300[Keyword: ^9966333rd Company^663300]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#672 (mes)
- "The 1st Squad of the 3rd Platoon is an exception, as all members retired or were transferred to other forces. More specific information can be found by searching ^9966333rd Platoon^663300."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#674 (mes)
- "^663300[Keyword: ^9966333rd Platoon^663300]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#675 (mes)
- "The 3rd Platoon is considered the elite force in the 3rd Company. Only records for the 1st Squad in the 3rd Platoon currently exist due to special circumstances.^000000"
