#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#693 (mes)
- "^663300[Keyword: ^9966331st Squad Record^663300]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#694 (mes)
- "The 1st Squad was famous as the most skilled search party within the Crusaders. However, it was disbanded as a result of its final mission.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#695 (mes)
- "^663300[Keyword: ^9966331st Squad Record^663300]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#696 (mes)
- "The 1st Squad was secretly"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#697 (mes)
- "assigned by the royal court to find and acquire ^996633godly artifacts^663300."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#698 (mes)
- "However, the mission failed due to a factional dispute caused by one member's act of insubordination.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#699 (mes)
- "^663300[Keyword: ^9966331st Squad Record^663300]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#700 (mes)
- "The member guilty of insubordination was dropped from the squad during this mission. However, his actions were enough to result in the failure of the 1st Squad's final mission.^000000"
