#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#701 (mes)
- "^663300[Keyword: ^9966331st Squad Record^663300]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#702 (mes)
- "Due to this disgraceful incident, the 1st Squad was disbanded and"
