#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#883 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#884 (mes)
- "Well..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#885 (mes)
- "This is a pretty"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#886 (mes)
- "obsolete version"
