#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#887 (mes)
- "of Search Magic,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#888 (mes)
- "so I understand if"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#889 (mes)
- "it's giving you trouble."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#890 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#891 (mes)
- "Now..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#892 (mes)
- "First, if you're going to enter a single search term, like someone's name, you would enter '^660000lee_hester^000000' if you were looking up 'Lee Hester.'"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#893 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#894 (mes)
- "Don't use any"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#895 (mes)
- "capital letters!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#896 (mes)
- "And use underscores to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#897 (mes)
- "indicate spaces between first and last names and within military unit names."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#898 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#899 (mes)
- "For example, the Fourth Company would be entered as ^6600004th_company^000000. Now... bear with me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#900 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#901 (mes)
- "If you're looking for information on a specific squad, you need to know the Platoon and Company it falls under."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#902 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#903 (mes)
- "For example, if you wanted to look up the Crusader 4th Squad of the 4th Platoon of the 4th Company, you would input..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#904 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#905 (mes)
- "'^660000crusader 4th_company 4th_platoon 4th_squad record^000000' all in one line exactly like that. I hope this helps you in your search..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#906 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#907 (mes)
- "You can tell our"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#908 (mes)
- "government doesn't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#909 (mes)
- "really know how to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#910 (mes)
- "allocate its funds"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#911 (mes)
- "and resources."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#912 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#913 (mes)
- "First, there's Jawaii."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#914 (mes)
- "Do newlyweds really need"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#915 (mes)
- "an entire island for themselves? Then again, I am single so I'm probably biased."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#916 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#917 (mes)
- "And look at me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#918 (mes)
- "Geniuses aren't supposed to waste their precious time doing useless things for libraries!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#919 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#920 (mes)
- "Ah, please do not touch any books in that section. ...I'm sure there's nothing there that could be useful to you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#921 (select)
- "Ignore him and check books.:Step back."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#922 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#923 (mes)
- "Hey...!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#924 (mes)
- "I thought I said"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#925 (mes)
- "not to touch those!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#927 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#928 (mes)
- "Thank you. Feel"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#929 (mes)
- "free to browse through"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#930 (mes)
- "the other sections."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#931 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#932 (mes)
- "It's really nice to have visitors in the Library, especially when so many people don't read books nowadays."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#933 (mes)
- "[Librarian Jekan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#934 (mes)
