#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#950 (mes)
- "It's really nice to have visitors in the Library, especially when so many people don't read books nowadays."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#951 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#952 (mes)
- "^333333*Phew...*^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#953 (mes)
- "This work is really getting to me. Going on a mission with my war buddies sounds a lot better than this."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#954 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#955 (mes)
- "At least in those days, I felt like I was actually doing something useful!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#956 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#957 (mes)
- "Hey..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#958 (mes)
- "Can I help you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#959 (mes)
- "with anything?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#960 (select)
- "Ask him about the 1st Squad.:Ask him how he's been doing.:Ask him about the 1st Squad's last mission."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#961 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#962 (mes)
- "Yeah, I was a member of the 1st Squad in the 3rd Platoon a long time ago. How did you know that?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#963 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#964 (mes)
- "I miss the guys back in the squad. I wonder how our leader's been doing recently..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#965 (mes)
- "^3355FFYou tell Zan about Rebarev Doug, and about how he is now an instructor for Crusader Boot Camp. He seems to be absorbed in his thoughts of the past.^000000"
