- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1068 (mes)
- "Good day!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1069 (mes)
- "Do you know the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1070 (mes)
- "importance of supply?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1071 (select)
- "No.:Yes!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1072 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1073 (mes)
- "Any military force or party needs their supplies to be replenished if they are to continue battling for a prolonged period of time."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1074 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1075 (mes)
- "For instance, let's say your group go on hunting without a healer. In this case, everyone would consume health restoration items, like potions."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1076 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1077 (mes)
- "Since you can only carry so many items at once, you'll eventually run out of potions."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1078 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1079 (mes)
- "But if one of your party members traveled between town and the hunting area, he could supply your party with new healing items."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1080 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1081 (mes)
- "Supplying your party in this way would let you hunt with less worry. For that duty, the Merchant class would be the best by using their Carts."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1082 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1083 (mes)
- "I suppose that's why I'm working here in the Blacksmith Guild. As weapon quartermaster, I'm obligated to provide supplies for the Crusader forces."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1084 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1085 (mes)
- "The Blacksmiths in this guild also help me provide high quality weapons for the Crusades as well."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1086 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1087 (mes)
- "If you happen to run out of health items while hunting, why don't you ask a Merchant for help?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1088 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1089 (mes)
- "Most likely, they will have some spare items and would be willing to share with you if you ask nicely enough."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1090 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1091 (mes)
- "I hope to see you later again! May Odin protect you on your journeys."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1092 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1093 (mes)
- "Oh..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1094 (mes)
- "Well then."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1095 (mes)
- "In that case."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1096 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1097 (mes)
- "Let me tell you about some useful knowledge I learned while working with the Blacksmiths."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1098 (mes)
- "[Zan.Huadoku]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1099 (mes)
- "A Blacksmith character's forging skills are affected by the DEX and LUK stats. DEX and LUK also affect the item creation skills for Alchemists."
