#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1270 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1271 (mes)
- "S-she's my sister."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1272 (mes)
- "And she's also a Rogue."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1273 (mes)
- "When I was retired from service...."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1274 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1275 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1276 (mes)
- "......"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1277 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1278 (mes)
- "My family always expected"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1279 (mes)
- "too much of me. That's why I used to be a Crusader. I mean, they're paid well and respected."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1280 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1281 (mes)
- "When I retired, my sister was so mad. She's the only one I can depend upon, but now that I've messed up my life like this..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1282 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1283 (mes)
- "But even after yelling at me, and saying I was worthless, she got "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1284 (mes)
- "me a job at her Inn anyway."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1285 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1286 (mes)
- "I've been working there,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1287 (mes)
- "living a quiet life. But now, for some reason, a lot of people want to talk to me about something important."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1288 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1289 (mes)
- "I don't know what I said or did, but I think when I gave them the right answer, after I could finally remember something, they tried to hurt me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1290 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1291 (mes)
- "So now my sister's been hiding"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1292 (mes)
- "me here. It's boring and lonely, and the guy downstairs is always yelling at me to leave."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1293 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1294 (mes)
- "Even the Rogue Guild that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1295 (mes)
- "my sister's a part of comes in sometimes to yell at me. They all want me to tell them something I'm supposed to know!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1296 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1297 (mes)
- "But I can't remember anything!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1298 (mes)
- "This place is safe from dangerous people, but I don't know for how long."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1299 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1300 (mes)
- "Even my sister says I have to tell the Rogue Guild what I should know, or they won't protect us anymore."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1301 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1302 (mes)
- "She looked really sad when she"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1303 (mes)
- "said that. I don't want to let her down or make her upset. She's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1304 (mes)
- "all I have left..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1305 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1306 (mes)
- "Oh, I do remember something!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1307 (mes)
- "My sister told me not to tell anyone, but I'm gonna tell you..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1308 (mes)
- "^3355FFCuaque Donon"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1309 (mes)
- "whispers into your ears.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1310 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1311 (mes)
- "^666666She said the Rogue Guild wants something from me. So she's gonna send to me to good people that we can trust and can help me.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1312 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1313 (mes)
- "^666666Still, this is the safest place for me for a while. But I'm always ready to run away if I have to.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1314 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1315 (mes)
- "How have I been doing?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1316 (mes)
- "Lots of people have been coming"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1317 (mes)
- "to see me. They all want me to tell them something I don't even know!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1318 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1319 (mes)
- "The Rogue Guild promised to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1320 (mes)
- "protect me, but they scare the hell out of me sometimes by coming out of the floor all of a sudden."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1321 (mes)
- "[Cuaque Donon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1322 (mes)
- "Oh, and my sister said she's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1323 (mes)
- "gonna complain to my old boss about something. She said I used to be fine, but now that I've retired, I'm not the same anymore."
