#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1515 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1516 (mes)
- "Oh, an adventurer! I actually used to work in the same field that you do. More specifically, I used to be a Crusader."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1517 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1518 (mes)
- "My name is Emma Searth. Right now, I'm following my dream and applying to be a Kafra Lady. So my days of wielding a sword are over."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1519 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1520 (mes)
- "Sadly, I haven't succeeded yet because I was diagnosed with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1521 (mes)
- "some weird ^0000FFamnesia^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1522 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1523 (mes)
- "Of course, I understand that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1524 (mes)
- "Kafra Corporation is a large, professional company, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1525 (mes)
- "if I can work for them even if it's just part-time..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1526 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1527 (mes)
- "Is it that big of a problem?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1528 (mes)
- "I suppose they're worried"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1529 (mes)
- "that I'd forget important customer information once I'm hired."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1530 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1531 (mes)
- "It's strange. When I was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1532 (mes)
- "a Crusader, I remembered"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1533 (mes)
- "everything lucidly, and I never had any problems recalling the past."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1534 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1535 (mes)
- "But now I get these migraines whenever I try to focus on my memories from those times"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1536 (mes)
- "when I used to fight in the Prontera Military."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1537 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1538 (mes)
- "^333333*Sigh...*^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1539 (select)
- "About her past.:Why be a Kafra Lady?:About memories she can remember."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1540 (mes)
- "^3355FFThe scent of your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1541 (mes)
- "Memory Bookmark"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1542 (mes)
- "seems to bring clarity"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1543 (mes)
- "to her thoughts.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1544 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1545 (mes)
- "I was born in a wealthy family where I was raised to learn etiquette, fencing, Peco riding, and music lessons since I was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1546 (mes)
- "born. I suppose you can say I'm pretty well educated."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1547 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1548 (mes)
- "However, my parents weren't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1549 (mes)
- "pleased when they learned that I wanted to become a Kafra Lady."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1550 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1551 (mes)
- "My parents insisted that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1552 (mes)
- "I become a Sage or a Scholar."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1553 (mes)
- "In the end, I ended up running"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1554 (mes)
- "away from them by joining the Crusaders."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1555 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1556 (mes)
- "Luckily, the Crusaders were advertising their recruitment at the time, so I took that chance. Plus, having military experience might even help me join Kafra!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1557 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1558 (mes)
- "Since I did so well in Boot Camp,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1559 (mes)
- "I got the chance to join an elite squad. My squad was often assigned difficult missions, and we never failed to complete those."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1560 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1561 (mes)
- "Eventually, my reputation as a female Crusader, and being in a respectable military position, was enough to satisfy my family."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1562 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1563 (mes)
- "But after that day,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1564 (mes)
- "everything went wrong."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1565 (mes)
- "I only remember that it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1566 (mes)
- "was very sad and depressing."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1567 (mes)
- "Somehow, I feel like we were"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1568 (mes)
- "even betrayed..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1569 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1570 (mes)
- "I think I can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1571 (mes)
- "try to remember"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1572 (mes)
- "my comrades..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1573 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1574 (mes)
- "Ah, let's not talk about it. It's too depressing. Maybe if you had some sort of ^0000FFmemory^000000 aid, I might be able to recall my forgotten past. Anything, like a reminder, a scheduler, a bookmark, a string..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1575 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1576 (mes)
- "One day, I happened to see Ms. Leilah at work here in Al De Baran. She was shining with confidence and commanded respect, even from her customers!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1577 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1578 (mes)
- "She carried herself like a professional, no matter what the situation. Even though I knew she was tired from working in the summer heat, she made everything look effortless!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1579 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1580 (mes)
- "When the male customers try to flirt with her, she never loses her poise. She just adjusts her glasses and does what she needs to do."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1581 (mes)
- "[Emma Searth]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1582 (mes)
