#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1721 (mes)
- "I can't help but feel sorry for that guy, E--"
+ "Não consigo deixar de sentir pena daquele cara, E--"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1722 (mes)
- "[Royal Myst]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1723 (mes)
- "Ergh...?"
+ "Ergh...?"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1724 (mes)
- "Damn, I can never remember his name. You'd think I wouldn't forget the guy whose rap I'm taking but... Eh, I'll remember once I sober up."
+ "Droga, nunca consigo lembrar o nome dele. Você pensaria que eu não esqueceria o cara cuja culpa eu estou levando mas... Ah, eu lembro quando ficar sóbrio."
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1725 (mes)
- "[Royal Myst]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1726 (mes)
- "Hey, what do you think happens to Crusaders when they're framed and killed, huh? Where exactly do they go? Niflheim, Vahalla...?"
+ "Ei, o que você acha que acontece com Templários quando são incriminados e mortos, hein? Para onde exatamente eles vão? Nifflheim, Valhalla...?"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1727 (mes)
- "Hobbies?"
+ "Passatempos?"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1728 (mes)
- "What, you comin'"
+ "O quê, você está dando"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1729 (mes)
- "on to me?"
+ "em cima de mim?"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1730 (mes)
- "[Royal Myst]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1731 (mes)
- "A man's hobby is drinking, or didn't you know that? I happen to be real good at it too! Mwahahaha!"
+ "O passatempo de um homem é beber, ou você não sabia? E acontece que eu sou muito bom nisso também! Muahahaha!"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1732 (mes)
- "[Royal Myst]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1733 (mes)
- "Speaking of which,"
+ "Falando nisso,"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1734 (mes)
- "I haven't had a drink"
+ "eu não tomo um trago"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1735 (mes)
- "for a looong time. Almost"
+ "faz um tempããão. Quase"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1736 (mes)
- "a couple hours now."
+ "umas duas horas já."
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1737 (mes)
- "[Royal Myst]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1738 (mes)
- "Oooh, looks like you've got a tasty beverage I can enjoy. Bwahahaha! Gimmie~!"
+ "Oooh, parece que você tem uma bebida gostosa que eu posso aproveitar. Buahahaha! Me dá~!"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1739 (mes)
- "^3355FFBefore you can even think,"
+ "^3355FFAntes que você consiga pensar,"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1740 (mes)
- "Royal Myst dips his hand into your inventory and helps himself to an Alcohol.^000000"
+ "Royal Myst enfia a mão no seu inventário e se serve de um Álcool.^000000"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1741 (mes)
- "[Royal Myst]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1742 (mes)
- "Why mention it? You gonna bring me something I'll like? Cuz I'm more than willing to take it! Bwahahaha!"
+ "Por que mencionar? Você vai me trazer algo de que eu goste? Porque eu estou mais do que disposto a aceitar! Buahahaha!"
#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1743 (mes)
