#: npc/quests/seals/megingard_seal.txt#1747 (mes)
- "know about me? You did me a favor, so I'll tell you anything! Eeeeeverythiiing~~!!"
+ "saber sobre mim? Você me fez um favor, então eu te conto qualquer coisa! Tuuuuudooo~~!!"
