+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#27 (mes)
- "Hmm, let me see..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#28 (mes)
- "[Metz]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#29 (mes)
- "Uh, it pains me to say this, but I don't think you qualified to help me out. Once you gain enough experience though, I'll be happy to have you on board~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#30 (mes)
- "[Metz]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#31 (mes)
- "Hey, I think you might"
