#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1201 (mes)
- "Such unbridled"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1202 (mes)
- "enthusiasm usually"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1203 (mes)
- "does more good than harm."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1204 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1205 (mes)
- "Mwah ah hah!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1206 (mes)
- "That's exactly what"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1207 (mes)
- "I wanted to hear! That"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1208 (mes)
- "kind of quiet and careful"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1209 (mes)
- "confidence will help you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1210 (mes)
- "in the future, you'll see~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1211 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1212 (mes)
- "E..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1213 (mes)
- "Excuse me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1214 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1215 (mes)
- "How can you be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1216 (mes)
- "so ridiculous at"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1217 (mes)
- "at time like this?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1218 (mes)
- "Either mind your manners"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1219 (mes)
- "or don't take this test at"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1220 (mes)
- "all! ^333333*SLAP--!!*^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1221 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1222 (mes)
- "Hmm. That kind of half-hearted"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1223 (mes)
- "attitude won't get you very far on your adventures. Still, so long as you don't get overly negative, you should have a decent chance of surviving your challenges."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1224 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1225 (mes)
- "Now, Metz expects me to ask"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1226 (mes)
- "some rather serious questions,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1227 (mes)
- "but that really isn't my style. For this test, why don't we just talk?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1228 (mes)
- "Just answer me honestly and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1229 (mes)
- "light heartedly, alright?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1230 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1231 (mes)
- "So..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1232 (mes)
- "Do you have a lot"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1233 (mes)
- "of friends that you can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1234 (mes)
- "constantly party with?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1235 (select)
- "Yes, I do.:I prefer soloing.:I am lonely."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1236 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1237 (mes)
- "Oh, that's great~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1238 (mes)
- "To have many friends"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1239 (mes)
- "is a priceless blessing."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1240 (mes)
- "Friends bring us joy and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1241 (mes)
- "aid when we find ourselves"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1242 (mes)
- "suffering from difficulties."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1243 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1244 (mes)
- "Wouldn't you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1245 (mes)
- "agree that being"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1246 (mes)
- "really close friends"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1247 (mes)
- "with someone can be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1248 (mes)
- "a life long benefit?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1249 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1250 (mes)
- "Well, everybody"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1251 (mes)
- "needs to be alone once"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1252 (mes)
- "in a while. And there are"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1253 (mes)
- "some battles you must"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1254 (mes)
- "fight all on your own."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1255 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1256 (mes)
- "Also, if you never"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1257 (mes)
- "deal with other people,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1258 (mes)
- "you may grow selfish or"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1259 (mes)
- "needy. It's better to go"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1260 (mes)
- "out and meet people,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1261 (mes)
- "don't you think?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1262 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1263 (mes)
- "You don't have any"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1264 (mes)
- "friends at all? Well,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1265 (mes)
- "you better learn how"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1266 (mes)
- "to get along with others"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1267 (mes)
- "as soon as you can...!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1268 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1269 (mes)
- "Now, what's your opinion"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1270 (mes)
- "on purposely getting lots"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1271 (mes)
- "of monsters to follow you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1272 (mes)
- "around. I believe this is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1273 (mes)
- "called ''Mob Training...''"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1274 (select)
- "Awesome~!:I hate people who do that.:I do it sometimes..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1275 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1276 (mes)
- "But..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1277 (mes)
- "Wouldn't that be really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1278 (mes)
- "rude to anyone else hunting"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1279 (mes)
- "on that same map? I think"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1280 (mes)
- "it would even interfere with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1281 (mes)
- "someone else's gameplay..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1282 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1283 (mes)
- "Perhaps you should try"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1284 (mes)
- "to consider other people's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1285 (mes)
- "feelings. Mob Training seems"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1286 (mes)
- "to only be good at getting other"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1287 (mes)
- "people angry with you..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1288 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1289 (mes)
- "Really?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1290 (mes)
- "I do too!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1291 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1292 (mes)
- "Just the other day, I've"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1293 (mes)
- "heard some ruffians boasting"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1294 (mes)
- "of their mob training activities. But personally, I feel they were compensating for their own shortcomings. "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1295 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1296 (mes)
- "Such behavior truly"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1297 (mes)
- "bothers me. Although I have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1298 (mes)
- "spent years in developing an"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1299 (mes)
- "unflappable personality, I find"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1300 (mes)
- "myself irked when encountering"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1301 (mes)
- "such troublemakers."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1302 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1303 (mes)
- "When you face obstacles"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1304 (mes)
- "in your own training, never give in to weakness. Assert yourself and find the determination to overcome your tribulations with honor!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1305 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1306 (mes)
- "At least you're honest."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1307 (mes)
- "But let me say that I cannot"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1308 (mes)
- "condone that sort of weak willed behavior. True strength can only"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1309 (mes)
- "be found through honor."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1310 (mes)
- "Remember that."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1311 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1312 (mes)
- "In the face of overwhelming"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1313 (mes)
- "odds, do not despair. After all, what is achievement if it is not earned without difficulty? The greater the challenge, the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1314 (mes)
- "greater the glory."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1315 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1316 (mes)
- "Even if you are having hard time,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1317 (mes)
- "try to take a firm stand."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1318 (mes)
- "One day, you will realise how strong you have become."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1319 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1320 (mes)
- "And..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1321 (mes)
- "Don't ever partake in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1322 (mes)
- "mob training again, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1323 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1324 (mes)
- "Anyway, I'm sure you're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1325 (mes)
- "aware of the War of Emperium"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1326 (mes)
- "in which mighty guilds all across Midgard battle for guild castle dominion. It's actually quite popular, really."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1327 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1328 (mes)
- "Now imagine that both of us"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1329 (mes)
- "are in the midst of a heated guild war. The sounds of explosions and earth shaking magic spells are all we can hear. At any time, we can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1330 (mes)
- "be lost in that mindless chaos."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1331 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1332 (mes)
- "Finally, through incredible"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1333 (mes)
- "good fortune, we manage to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1334 (mes)
- "infiltrate the enemy guild castle and reach their Emperium. If we destroy that Emperium, that castle will belong to our guild."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1335 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1336 (mes)
- "However...! This is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1337 (mes)
- "no ordinary Emperium!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1338 (mes)
- "It is a masterful sculpture"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1339 (mes)
- "of a gorgeous Priestess!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1340 (mes)
- "Answer me, adventurer!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1341 (mes)
- "Would you still destroy it?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1342 (select)
- "Destroy it!:I can't destroy such beauty...:I'd close my eyes, then destroy it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1343 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1344 (mes)
- "Hmm. You have a truly"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1345 (mes)
- "strong will. Then again,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1346 (mes)
- "perhaps you lack a true"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1347 (mes)
- "appreciation for beauty."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1348 (mes)
- "Even in Emperium form, how"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1349 (mes)
- "could you harm a Priestess?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1350 (mes)
- "perhaps you cannot appreciate"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1351 (mes)
- "a Priestess's beauty in the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1352 (mes)
- "way that a man would."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1353 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1354 (mes)
- "Ah yes! I felt you would answer that way! We must cherish and protect what is beautiful in this world. I would never be able to harm a Priestess, even in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1355 (mes)
- "statue form..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1356 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1357 (mes)
- "Interesting...!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1358 (mes)
- "Although you cherish"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1359 (mes)
- "the beauty of the Priestess,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1360 (mes)
- "your loyalty to your guild"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1361 (mes)
- "proves stronger. A most"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1362 (mes)
- "admirable attitude!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1363 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1364 (mes)
- "But yes, if it were"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1365 (mes)
- "me, I would protect that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1366 (mes)
- "Priestess shaped Emperium"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1367 (mes)
- "until the end of the guild war."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1368 (mes)
- "Mwah ah hah~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1369 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1370 (mes)
- "While we're on the topic"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1371 (mes)
- "of guilds, let me present"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1372 (mes)
- "another guild related scenario. Let's say that you joined a very popular guild with many allies,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1373 (mes)
- "as well as formidable enemies."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1374 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1375 (mes)
- "Now, during one of your."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1376 (mes)
- "hunts, you happen to meet"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1377 (mes)
- "a member of one of your enemy guilds. The two of you are the only people on that map. Suddenly, he finds himself in mortal danger!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1378 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1379 (mes)
- "This enemy guild member"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1380 (mes)
- "begins to yell for help. Now,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1381 (mes)
- "would you give your enemy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1382 (mes)
- "the help that he needs?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1383 (select)
- "Yes, of course!:I'd pretend not to hear anything.:I'd make fun of him, then run off."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1384 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1385 (mes)
- "Ah, you would help him!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1386 (mes)
- "Good, good. I'm glad to see"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1387 (mes)
- "that you understand that such pettiness should not get in the way of doing what is good and right."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1388 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1389 (mes)
- "True, you're not really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1390 (mes)
- "obligated to help your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1391 (mes)
- "enemy. Besides, you may"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1392 (mes)
- "hurt his feelings once he"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1393 (mes)
- "realizes that he's had to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1394 (mes)
- "depend on his rival for help."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1395 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1396 (mes)
- "Even though he is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1397 (mes)
- "your enemy, I still"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1398 (mes)
- "believe it's important"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1399 (mes)
- "that you treat him with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1400 (mes)
- "respect. Where is your honor?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1401 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1402 (mes)
- "Well, there's one"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1403 (mes)
- "last thing I want to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1404 (mes)
- "know about you. It's the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1405 (mes)
- "most important question"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1406 (mes)
- "in the world once you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1407 (mes)
- "think about it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1408 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1409 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1410 (mes)
- "......"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1411 (mes)
- "Do you enjoy life?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1412 (select)
- "Yes:No"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1413 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1414 (mes)
- "I'm glad."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1415 (mes)
- "When you don't live"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1416 (mes)
- "with zeal, it's easy to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1417 (mes)
- "forget your goals and your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1418 (mes)
- "purpose for living. Don't have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1419 (mes)
- "any? Then make some up."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1420 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1421 (mes)
- "I hope you always enjoy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1422 (mes)
- "life as much as you can."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1423 (mes)
- "As for me, I'm always happy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1424 (mes)
- "with my wine, women and song~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1425 (mes)
- "Mwah ah hah~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1426 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1427 (mes)
- "I understand."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1428 (mes)
- "People cannot be happy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1429 (mes)
- "all the time. Sometimes"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1430 (mes)
- "it's easy to forget your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1431 (mes)
- "goals and purpose in life."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1432 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1433 (mes)
- "But you know what? If you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1434 (mes)
- "have just one dream, one goal"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1435 (mes)
- "to strive towards, things shall get better. If you think you don't have dreams, look back to your past. What you remember may surprise you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1436 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1437 (mes)
- "It's important to look forward,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1438 (mes)
- "but first you must find what is truly precious to you before you can define your happiness. That's why I think it's good to experience new things as well as reflect."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1439 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1440 (mes)
- "Now, what's precious to me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1441 (mes)
- "Three things, actually..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1442 (mes)
- "Wine. Women. And song!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1443 (mes)
- "Though, if I had to rank them,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1444 (mes)
- "women would top that list."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1445 (mes)
- "Mwah ah hah~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1446 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1447 (mes)
- "Well, I must say that I've"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1448 (mes)
- "grown quite fond of you. Of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1449 (mes)
- "course, it helps that we have so much in common. Mwah ah hah~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1450 (mes)
- "It was an honor to meet you~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1451 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1452 (mes)
- "Oh yes! Your next test"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1453 (mes)
- "examiner is ^CE0000Sir Jore^000000, also"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1454 (mes)
- "known as the Ghost of Al de Baran. Although he's always sick, he has great passion for his research."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1455 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1456 (mes)
- "Alright, then."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1457 (mes)
- "Good luck in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1458 (mes)
- "Al de Baran~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1459 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1460 (mes)
- "It pains me to say this,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1461 (mes)
- "but I do not think you're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1462 (mes)
- "worthy of holding my fragment"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1463 (mes)
- "of the Sobbing Starlight. But"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1464 (mes)
- "I am willing to give you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1465 (mes)
- "another chance~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1466 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1467 (mes)
- "You know, after talking with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1468 (mes)
- "you for a while, I now feel fairly comfortable with leaving you this piece of the Sobbing Starlight. Somehow, I think you're strong enough to get all the pieces."
