#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1526 (mes)
- "Mwah ah hah~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1527 (mes)
- "[Daewoon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1528 (mes)
- "Eh...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1529 (mes)
- "That's quite a surprise."
