#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1599 (select)
- ", thanks."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1600 (mes)
- "[Sir Jore]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1601 (mes)
- "N-nice to meet you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1602 (mes)
- "My name is Jore. Just"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1603 (mes)
- "a normal person who loves"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1604 (mes)
- "research. S-sorry if I seem"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1605 (mes)
- "a little nervous! I'm actually"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1606 (mes)
- "quite... shy around people."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1607 (mes)
- "[Sir Jore]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1608 (mes)
- "Oh no...!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1609 (mes)
- "If you were able to"
