#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1611 (mes)
- "others! When would I get"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1612 (mes)
- "the time to do my research?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1613 (mes)
- "N-no! I h-h-hate people!!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1614 (mes)
- "[Sir Jore]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1615 (mes)
- "Still, I did promise"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1616 (mes)
- "M-M-Metz and he is my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1617 (mes)
- "friend. So I must accept"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1618 (mes)
- "some guests. Even if hundreds"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1619 (mes)
- "of them knock on my door..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1620 (mes)
- "[Sir Jore]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1621 (mes)
- "But first of all,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1622 (mes)
- "I'm going to need"
