#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1627 (mes)
- "[Sir Jore]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1628 (mes)
- "N-now, d-don't worry."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1629 (mes)
- "The items are actually"
