+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1868 (select)
- "What do you do in here?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1869 (mes)
- "[Piru Piru]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1870 (mes)
- "My master, Sir Jore,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1871 (mes)
- "is researching a way to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1872 (mes)
- "create artificial life! Still,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1873 (mes)
- "it's not easy and we haven't"
