#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1874 (mes)
- "accomplished anything yet..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1875 (mes)
- "[Piru Piru]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1876 (mes)
- "It doesn't help that my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1877 (mes)
- "master spends all of his"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1878 (mes)
- "time on research. He hasn't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1879 (mes)
- "been taking care of himself"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1880 (mes)
- "and is losing a lot of weight."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1881 (mes)
- "I'm really worried about him."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1882 (mes)
- "Everyday we study and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1883 (mes)
- "take notes and test and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1884 (mes)
- "experiment and record"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1885 (mes)
- "results and... Horrible!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1886 (mes)
- "[Piru Piru]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1887 (mes)
- "Although my master and I are the only ones who use this lab, we do have a set working schedule. We work from 10 AM to 5 PM and have our free time from 5 PM to 10 PM, which is when Master goes to bed."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1888 (mes)
- "[Piru Piru]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#1889 (mes)
- "Of course, Master"
