- "[Pleur]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2128 (mes)
- "I hope you understand that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2129 (mes)
- "my father and I devoted and sacrificed so much for our work. Finally, we discovered a way to summon monsters using potions."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2130 (mes)
- "[Pleur]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2131 (mes)
- "However, too many Alchemists"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2132 (mes)
- "hounded us for our information"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2133 (mes)
