+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2134 (mes)
- "of our research. It was more"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2135 (mes)
- "than we could handle..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2136 (mes)
- "[Gordon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2137 (mes)
- "I'm sorry, but if you have any"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2138 (mes)
- "questions about Alchemy, there"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2139 (mes)
- "are many qualified researchers and practitioners out there. We came to this forest to find peace..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2140 (mes)
- "[Gordon]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2141 (mes)
- "Hah hah hah~"
