- "what you were"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2144 (mes)
- "going to ask me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2145 (mes)
- "Sometimes I miss"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2146 (mes)
- "being an alchemist."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2147 (mes)
- "But then again, a man"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2148 (mes)
- "of my brilliance and genius"
