#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2212 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2213 (mes)
- "Anyway, I'm so proud"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2214 (mes)
- "of my supreme intelligence!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2215 (mes)
- "I may be somewhat obsessive"
