#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2216 (mes)
- "about studying, but that's just another reason to admire me~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2217 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2218 (mes)
- "The Wizard and Sage"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2219 (mes)
- "exams? No problem~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2220 (mes)
- "Even the Alchemist test"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2221 (mes)
- "was fairly simple. So far"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2222 (mes)
- "I haven't met anyone"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2223 (mes)
- "smarter than me~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2224 (select)
- "^333333Stuck-up chick.^000000:Take it easy on the drinks..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2225 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2226 (mes)
- "What...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2227 (mes)
- "What did you say?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2228 (mes)
- "No one has ever"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2229 (mes)
- "said anything like"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2230 (mes)
- "that to me before!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2231 (mes)
- "H-how dare you..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2232 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2233 (mes)
- "Prove that you can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2234 (mes)
- "hold a candle to my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2235 (mes)
- "superior intellect and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2236 (mes)
- "I'll be willing to accept"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2237 (mes)
- "your little insult! It's time"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2238 (mes)
- "for a Quiz Challenge!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2239 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2240 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2241 (mes)
- "Quiz... Challenge?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2242 (mes)
- "Like a trivia game?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2243 (mes)
- "But who's going to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2244 (mes)
- "ask us the questions?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2246 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2247 (mes)
- "Did someone say"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2248 (mes)
- "''Quiz Challenge?''"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2249 (mes)
- "I believe I can be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2250 (mes)
- "of assistance."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2251 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2252 (mes)
- "Professor Aaron?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2253 (mes)
- "Ho ho~ If he's asking"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2254 (mes)
- "the questions, it looks"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2255 (mes)
- "like your chances of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2256 (mes)
- "beating me are zero!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2257 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2258 (mes)
- "Ho ho ho~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2259 (mes)
- "Plenty of people have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2260 (mes)
- "told me not to drink so"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2261 (mes)
- "much. But once I start"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2262 (mes)
- "I can't stop. I love to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2263 (mes)
- "drink that much!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2264 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2265 (mes)
- "And..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2266 (mes)
- "Sometimes I'd rather"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2267 (mes)
- "look at the world through"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2268 (mes)
- "these hazy eyes. See things"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2269 (mes)
- "the way I want to see them..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2270 (mes)
- "It amuses me that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2271 (mes)
- "you think that you'd"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2272 (mes)
- "stand a chance against"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2273 (mes)
- "me in a Quiz Challenge."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2274 (mes)
- "Ho ho ho ho ho~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2275 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2276 (mes)
- "Professor Aaron"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2277 (mes)
- "is waiting for you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2278 (mes)
- "to ask him to begin."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2279 (mes)
- "And I'm waiting for the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2280 (mes)
- "moment when you realize"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2281 (mes)
- "you have no hope of winning!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2282 (mes)
- "Bwahahahaha!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2283 (mes)
- "You should have known"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2284 (mes)
- "from the beginning that you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2285 (mes)
- "never had a chance! Of course,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2286 (mes)
- "I did, but you know, I guess you had to learn for yourself."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2287 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2288 (mes)
- "I'd insult you if it weren't for the fact that you embarassed yourself enough during the Quiz Challenge. As a matter of fact, I'll even forgive you for wounding my pride earlier."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2289 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2290 (mes)
- "Can you believe it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2291 (mes)
- "Even drunk I can beat"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2292 (mes)
- "you in a test of intelligence!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2293 (mes)
- "Bwahaha! I can't believe how"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2294 (mes)
- "simple minded you are...!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2295 (select)
- "I can't let you win!:Darn it..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2296 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2297 (mes)
- "You're a slow learner,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2298 (mes)
- "aren't you? Well, I welcome"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2299 (mes)
- "your ''challenge'' anytime!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2300 (mes)
- "Bwah hah hah hah hah~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2301 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2302 (mes)
- "Just now you realize"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2303 (mes)
- "how pitiful your intellect"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2304 (mes)
- "is compared to mine? Ho ho ho!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2305 (mes)
- "There's hope for every fool!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2306 (mes)
- "What...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2307 (mes)
- "I... I..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2308 (mes)
- "I don't b-believe it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2309 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2310 (mes)
- "I lost..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2311 (mes)
- "M-maybe you were right."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2312 (mes)
- "I am arrogant after all..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2313 (mes)
- "I should stop drinking so"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2314 (mes)
- "much. Travel around and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2315 (mes)
- "broaden my knowledge..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2316 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2317 (mes)
- "You're the only"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2318 (mes)
- "one who has been"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2319 (mes)
- "able to beat me in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2320 (mes)
- "a battle of minds."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2321 (mes)
- "W-who are you...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2322 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2324 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2325 (mes)
- "I will remember that."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2326 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2327 (mes)
- "Here..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2328 (mes)
- "My old friend, Metz, told"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2329 (mes)
- "me to give this to someone"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2330 (mes)
- "who is worthy. I was going"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2331 (mes)
- "to keep it, but I suppose"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2332 (mes)
- "you're its true owner..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2333 (mes)
- "[Jesqurienne]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#2334 (mes)
- "If you want to know more about the Sobbing Starlight, find a man named ^3131CEDearles^000000. It may be hard to find him since he wanders from place to place, but it might help to know that he loves gambling..."
