- "[Bakerlan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3409 (mes)
- "Ah, now I see that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3410 (mes)
- "you speak the truth."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3411 (mes)
- "Alright, we can begin my test."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3412 (mes)
- "[Bakerlan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3413 (mes)
- "First, I wish for you to make"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3414 (mes)
- "a delivery. The object I want you to deliver is expensive and must be handled with care. Don't lose it or you will fail. Now, speak to my steward for more information."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3415 (mes)
- "[Bakerlan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3416 (mes)
- "Hm? It's not possible for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3417 (mes)
- "you to have this many pieces"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3418 (mes)
- "of the Sobbing Starlight!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3419 (mes)
- "These must be fakes. How"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3420 (mes)
- "dare you! Leave me!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3421 (mes)
- "Please speak to my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3422 (mes)
- "steward for all matters"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3423 (mes)
- "related to the delivery"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3424 (mes)
- "that you must complete"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3425 (mes)
- "for my test."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3426 (mes)
- "Ah yes, Mahatra tells"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3427 (mes)
- "me that you've completed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3428 (mes)
- "the delivery. Well, um, he now"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3429 (mes)
- "has another assignment for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3430 (mes)
- "for you to complete. So"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3431 (mes)
- "please talk to him again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3432 (mes)
- "You have not finished yet."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3433 (mes)
- "Why don't you go finish them first?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3434 (mes)
- "I am a busy businessman."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3435 (mes)
- "Ah, I was informed about you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3436 (mes)
- "Well, although you have your goal,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3437 (mes)
- "that does not necessarily mean to help that kid."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3438 (mes)
- "Metz must have an eye for a right person, I assume."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3439 (mes)
- "[Bakerlan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3440 (mes)
- "Well, I wanted to assign you some various tasks"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3441 (mes)
- "on my own plan, but recently I am very busy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3442 (mes)
- "to take care of tradings with Kunlun and Amatsu."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3443 (mes)
- "[Bakerlan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3444 (mes)
- "I found Seyling while I was trading with Amatsu few years ago."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3445 (mes)
- "I introduced her brother to the royal family of Prontera, too."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3446 (mes)
- "But anyways,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3447 (mes)
- "[Bakerlan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3448 (mes)
- "I want to test you longer, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3449 (mes)
- "I am too busy for that. Also I don't think it is good for you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3450 (mes)
- "Let's finish the test now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3451 (mes)
- "You are qualified enough already."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3452 (mes)
- "[Bakerlan]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3453 (mes)
- "There you go."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3454 (mes)
- "I am the last one who tested your qualification."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3455 (mes)
- "Now bring all of the stone pieces to Metz."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3456 (mes)
- "He will tell you what you need to do next."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3457 (mes)
- "Umm...."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3458 (mes)
- "Did I see you wrong? Or did Metz do?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3459 (mes)
- "...I do not have any more business with you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3460 (mes)
- "Take care now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3461 (mes)
- "Umm...well then..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3462 (mes)
- "I shall take the action for Prontera..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3463 (mes)
- "And for Juno..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3464 (mes)
- "Awww...."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3465 (mes)
- "Gosh, this is such a pain in the ass..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3466 (mes)
- "Mumble mumble..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3467 (mes)
- "How is it going?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3468 (mes)
- "In fact, we want to do it on our own..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3469 (mes)
- "but we are too preoccupied with our works..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3470 (mes)
- "I hope you will keep up the good work."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3471 (mes)
- "I am also curious what that stone is."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3473 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3474 (mes)
- "I'm sorry, but I'm"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3475 (mes)
- "busy cleaning the manor"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3476 (mes)
- "right now so I don't have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3477 (mes)
- "time to talk. Oh, and would"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3478 (mes)
- "you please wipe your shoes"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3479 (mes)
- "on the mat before coming in?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3480 (mes)
- "Leibech...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3481 (mes)
- "I remember that he's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3482 (mes)
- "a regular customer who"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3483 (mes)
- "orders the strangest things."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3484 (mes)
- "Last I heard, he was traveling"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3485 (mes)
- "near Mount Mjolnir."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3486 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3487 (mes)
- "Yes, that was where"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3488 (mes)
- "his last order was sent"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3489 (mes)
- "to. Hm, I wonder. Do you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3490 (mes)
- "think he could have been"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3491 (mes)
- "heading towards the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3492 (mes)
- "Schwarzwald Republic?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3493 (mes)
- "Ooooh..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3494 (mes)
- "What am I going"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3495 (mes)
- "to do?! Oh-- You"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3496 (mes)
- "startled me!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3497 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3498 (mes)
- "I'm sorry, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3499 (mes)
- "I was just thinking"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3500 (mes)
- "about something. I hope"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3501 (mes)
- "I didn't bother you. ^333333*Sigh*^000000"
