+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3512 (mes)
- "Oh dear..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3513 (mes)
- "What can I do"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3514 (mes)
- "about this...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3515 (select)
- "Ignore her.:Excuse me, but Mahatra sent me..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3516 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3517 (mes)
- "Oh, it's no use"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3518 (mes)
- "worrying about"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3519 (mes)
- "something I can do"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3520 (mes)
- "nothing about. I better"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3521 (mes)
- "get back to work..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3522 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3523 (mes)
- "Mister Mahatra"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3524 (mes)
- "sent you to me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3525 (mes)
- "Hm? Does he need"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3526 (mes)
- "me for anything?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3527 (select)
- "Actually, he wants me to help you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3528 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3529 (mes)
- "Oh, how very kind!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3530 (mes)
- "Yes, yes, I could use"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3531 (mes)
- "some help right now!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3532 (mes)
- "You see, it'll be my brother's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3533 (mes)
- "birthday, but I'm so busy with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3534 (mes)
- "work that I can't see him."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3535 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3536 (mes)
- "The last time I saw him,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3537 (mes)
- "he looked so tired and weak"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3538 (mes)
- "so it's worrying me. Now, I've"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3539 (mes)
- "heard there's some new medicine"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3540 (mes)
- "called ^FF0000Vigorgra^000000. I don't know much about it, but it should help him!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3541 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3542 (mes)
- "Do you think you could"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3543 (mes)
- "find that medicine and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3544 (mes)
- "bring it to me? If you don't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3545 (mes)
- "want to, I understand. Plus,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3546 (mes)
- "I don't know if the master"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3547 (mes)
- "would approve of this..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3548 (select)
- "I can't do it.:Let me think about it.:Sure, why not?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3549 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3550 (mes)
- "Oh, really?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3551 (mes)
- "Alright, I can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3552 (mes)
- "understand. I'm"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3553 (mes)
- "very sorry to bother"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3554 (mes)
- "you with my problems."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3555 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3556 (mes)
- "Oh okay."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3557 (mes)
- "Take your time."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3558 (mes)
- "If you can help"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3559 (mes)
- "me, I'd really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3560 (mes)
- "appreciate it~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3561 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3562 (mes)
- "Oh, thank you so much!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3563 (mes)
- "Now, I remember hearing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3564 (mes)
- "that you can find Vigorgra"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3565 (mes)
- "somewhere in Al de Baran."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3566 (mes)
- "Somebody in the Alchemist"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3567 (mes)
- "Guild makes it, I think."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3568 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3569 (mes)
- "I'm sorry, but I don't"
