- "that, I don't know much..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3631 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3632 (mes)
- "Once you get it,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3633 (mes)
- "would you bring"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3634 (mes)
- "the Vigorgra to me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3635 (mes)
- "Oh, you know where"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3636 (mes)
- "you can get Vigorgra?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3637 (mes)
- "That's great news!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3638 (mes)
- "Oh, when you have it,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3639 (mes)
- "bring to me, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3640 (mes)
- "Hurray~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3641 (mes)
- "You brought the"
