#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3644 (mes)
- "be happy with this!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3645 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3646 (mes)
- "Oh! Would you please"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3647 (mes)
- "bring this Vigorgra to my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3648 (mes)
- "brother? His name is Maruin"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3649 (mes)
- "and he's working over at"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3650 (mes)
- "the Prontera Castle."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3651 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3652 (mes)
- "Ah, I almost forgot!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3653 (mes)
- "I just finished writing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3654 (mes)
- "him this letter, so would"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3655 (mes)
- "you also make sure he gets"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3656 (mes)
- "this? Thank you so much!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3657 (mes)
- "Would you please"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3658 (mes)
- "deliver the Vigorgra"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3659 (mes)
- "and my letter to my brother"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3660 (mes)
- "Maruin in the Prontera Castle?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3661 (mes)
- "And wish him 'Happy Birthday~'"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3662 (mes)
- "Thanks so much"
