#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3663 (mes)
- "for your help again!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3664 (mes)
- "I want you to have this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3665 (mes)
- "as a token of my gratitude."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3666 (mes)
- "You really are a kind person~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3667 (mes)
- "Oh no~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3668 (mes)
- "Please don't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3669 (mes)
- "drag your muddy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3670 (mes)
- "feet over the carpet!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3671 (mes)
- "Would you please leave?"
+ ""
