- "busy cleaning the manor"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3674 (mes)
- "right now so I don't have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3675 (mes)
- "time to talk. Oh, and would"
