#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3676 (mes)
- "you please wipe your shoes"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3677 (mes)
- "on the mat before coming in?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3678 (mes)
- "Although the master isn't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3679 (mes)
- "a messy person, he's pretty"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3680 (mes)
- "unorganized. I wish he'd make"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3681 (mes)
- "it easier for me to tell which"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3682 (mes)
- "papers are documents and "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3683 (mes)
- "which ones are trash..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3684 (mes)
- "[Seylin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3685 (mes)
- "So how have you been?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3686 (mes)
- "Is everything okay with you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3687 (mes)
- "I hope you have a lot of good"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3688 (mes)
- "experiences in your adventures~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3690 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3691 (mes)
- "Welcome to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3692 (mes)
- "Prontera Castle."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3693 (mes)
- "Please be careful"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3694 (mes)
- "and avoid getting lost."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3695 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3696 (mes)
- "Oh man..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3697 (mes)
- "I'm so tired~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3698 (mes)
- "Enervated, even~"
