+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3715 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3716 (mes)
- "What's that?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3717 (mes)
- "You're here for"
