#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3724 (mes)
- "OH. It is my birthday."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3725 (mes)
- "Ha! I completely forgot!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3726 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3727 (mes)
- "Thanks for coming"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3728 (mes)
- "all the way out here"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3729 (mes)
- "to deliver my present!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3730 (mes)
- "Wow, I wonder what she"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3731 (mes)
- "got for me this year?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3732 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3733 (mes)
- "Th-this is--!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3734 (mes)
- "Oh. Snap. That's right."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3735 (mes)
- "She's been worried about"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3736 (mes)
- "me being tired lately. But"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3737 (mes)
- "does she even know what"
