#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3738 (mes)
- "Vigorgra is supposed to...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3739 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3740 (mes)
- "Never mind. It's the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3741 (mes)
- "thought that counts."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3742 (mes)
- "But for the record, it's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3743 (mes)
- "not like I need this stuff."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3744 (mes)
- "I mean, I have, you know,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3745 (mes)
- "a girlfr--you know what I mean."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3746 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3747 (mes)
- "I'd like to pay you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3748 (mes)
- "back, but since I'm"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3749 (mes)
- "on duty, all I can do"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3750 (mes)
- "is replenish your health."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3751 (mes)
- "I'm not really supposed to,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3752 (mes)
- "but no one will say anything."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3753 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3754 (mes)
- "Well, thanks for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3755 (mes)
- "the letter and the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3756 (mes)
- "male supplement, I guess."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3757 (mes)
- "I'll send a message to my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3758 (mes)
- "sister. Good luck on your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3759 (mes)
- "travels, alright?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3760 (mes)
- "Welcome to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3761 (mes)
- "Prontera Castle."
