#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3762 (mes)
- "Please be careful"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3763 (mes)
- "and avoid getting lost."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3764 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3765 (mes)
- "Oh man..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3766 (mes)
- "I'm so tired~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3767 (mes)
- "Enervated, even~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3768 (mes)
- "If I only had some"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3769 (mes)
- "kind of refreshment..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3770 (mes)
- "Oh hey, how's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3771 (mes)
- "it going? Thanks"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3772 (mes)
- "again for helping"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3773 (mes)
- "out my sister, we"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3774 (mes)
- "really appreciate it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3775 (mes)
- "[Maruin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3776 (mes)
- "Oh..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3777 (mes)
- "And just between you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3778 (mes)
- "and me, that Vigorgra"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3779 (mes)
- "really came in handy!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3780 (mes)
- "That stuff's amazing!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3782 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3783 (mes)
- "Most Alchemists seek out the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3784 (mes)
- "Stone of Sage, but in my opinion, their goals are too short sighted. There are more important studies"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3785 (mes)
- "to be conducted in the name of science for the good of mankind..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3786 (select)
- "...:So what are you studying?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3787 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3788 (mes)
- "In the end, the "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3789 (mes)
- "Stone of Sage may"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3790 (mes)
- "just be a simple rumor."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3791 (mes)
- "After all, thousands of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3792 (mes)
- "Alchemists have already"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3793 (mes)
- "failed to create it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3794 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3795 (mes)
- "What am I studying?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3796 (mes)
- "Well, my expertise is..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3797 (mes)
- "Different. If you must"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3798 (mes)
- "know, it's a secret~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3799 (mes)
- "If any man found out"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3800 (mes)
- "about my research..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3801 (mes)
- "Eh...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3802 (mes)
- "What do you need?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3803 (mes)
- "If it's not important,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3804 (mes)
- "please leave my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3805 (mes)
- "laboratory!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3806 (select)
- "Vigorgra?:Oh, I'm sorry."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3807 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3808 (mes)
- "What?! Who told you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3809 (mes)
- "that I could make that?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3810 (mes)
- "Oh, no matter. I suppose"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3811 (mes)
- "you want me to get some"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3812 (mes)
- "ready for you. Now tell me..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3813 (mes)
- "Why do you want it?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3814 (select)
- "No, I don't want it!:I need Vigorgra for... a friend."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3815 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3816 (mes)
- "You immature--!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3817 (mes)
- "You come all this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3818 (mes)
- "way to bother me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3819 (mes)
- "Don't bring your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3820 (mes)
- "shame into my lab!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3821 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3822 (mes)
- "Oh right."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3823 (mes)
- "Your friend."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3824 (mes)
- "I understand you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3825 (mes)
- "Crystal clear."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3826 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3827 (mes)
- "Well, since you know"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3828 (mes)
- "about my secret research,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3829 (mes)
- "I'll do you a favor so long as"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3830 (mes)
- "you don't tell anyone else!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3831 (mes)
- "Of course, I can't just give"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3832 (mes)
- "you Vigorgra for free..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3833 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3834 (mes)
- "Now, write this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3835 (mes)
- "down. These are the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3836 (mes)
- "ingredients I need to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3837 (mes)
- "make a bottle of Vigorgra."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3838 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3839 (mes)
- "^ff00001 Ment"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3840 (mes)
- "20 Honey"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3841 (mes)
- "10 Royal Jelly"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3842 (mes)
- "30 Bear's Footskin"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3843 (mes)
- "1 Hinalle Leaflet"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3844 (mes)
- "1 Empty Bottle.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3845 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3846 (mes)
- "Alright."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3847 (mes)
- "Now go and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3848 (mes)
- "bring all those"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3849 (mes)
- "items to me. I'll"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3850 (mes)
- "be seeing you later."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3851 (mes)
- "[Melkaba]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3852 (mes)
- "There's no need"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3853 (mes)
- "to apologize. But"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3854 (mes)
- "I'd appreciate it if"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3855 (mes)
- "you'd let me work"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3856 (mes)
- "in peace."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3857 (mes)
- "Hmmm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3858 (mes)
- "So did you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#3859 (mes)
- "bring everything"
+ ""
