+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4057 (mes)
- "be doing it for the Sobbing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4058 (mes)
- "Starlight, I really appreciate"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4059 (mes)
- "all your help. Seylin's a very"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4060 (mes)
- "nice girl and doesn't deserve"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4061 (mes)
