+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4428 (mes)
- "My dad never broke anything"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4429 (mes)
- "his customers gave him. And my uncle Hollgrehenn and Aragham wouldn't let anything like that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4430 (mes)
- "happen, would they?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4431 (mes)
- "Would you please bring my letter over to my dad? Heh heh, he'll be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4432 (mes)
- "so happy to hear from me!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4433 (mes)
- "Yay~!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4434 (mes)
- "Thank you for bringing my letter to my dad. Here, here!"
