- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4450 (mes)
- "Thank you so much!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4451 (mes)
- "If it weren't for your help,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4452 (mes)
- "I'd be in big trouble. I really appreciate you stepping in and volunteering your materials like this."
+ ""
