#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4528 (mes)
- "But I can't guarantee success."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4529 (mes)
- "Ah..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4530 (mes)
- "An Oridecon Avil."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4531 (mes)
- "This isn't too bad,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4532 (mes)
- "but there's a good risk"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4533 (mes)
- "that this might not work."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4534 (mes)
- "Ah..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4535 (mes)
- "A Golden Anvil."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4536 (mes)
- "This just might be able to do the job. This might take a while, so I have something to ask of you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4537 (mes)
- "Oh wow, an Emperium Anvil!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4538 (mes)
- "And this looks like one I might have actually made. Great, I should be able to do this so long as I don't make any critical mistakes~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4539 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4540 (mes)
- "While I'm working on this, would you deliver a letter to my family for me? I'm sorry, but please consider that I'm waiving the fee for restoring this Sobbing Starlight."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4541 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4542 (mes)
- "Well then..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4543 (mes)
- "I wish you safety"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4544 (mes)
- "in your travels."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4545 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4546 (mes)
- "Oh, you don't have everything ready yet? Take your time, so long as you didn't forget what you needed to bring. You do remember, right?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4547 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4548 (mes)
- "^FF00005 Mini Furnace^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4549 (mes)
- "^FF00002 Oridecon Hammer^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4550 (mes)
- "and ^ff00001 good quality Anvil^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4551 (mes)
- "That's all you need!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4552 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4553 (mes)
- "Remember that I have a greater chance of repairing the Sobbing Starlight if I have access to a higher quality Anvil. Otherwise..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4554 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4555 (mes)
- "Still don't have everything ready? That's fine, just take your time. So long as you haven't forgotten all the things that you need. I mean, how can you forget when you have such an important ore on you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4556 (mes)
- "Are you back already?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4557 (mes)
- "Sorry, but I haven't quite finished yet. I won't be done for a while, so why don't you deliver that letter to my family?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4558 (mes)
- "Are you back already?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4559 (mes)
- "While you were gone, I managed to restore this Sobbing Starlight. Why don't you go ahead and take a look?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4560 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4561 (mes)
- "This was one of the most difficult jobs I've ever done. But look! It was beautiful when broken in fragments but now it's absolutely dazzling! This was really worth my effort."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4562 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4563 (mes)
- "In any case, I worked really hard to do a good job on this, so I hope you treasure this Sobbling Starlight, young adventurer."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4564 (mes)
- "You've returned?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4565 (mes)
- "Well, I don't know how to put this, but once you hear it, don't take it the wrong way..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4566 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4567 (mes)
- "^333333*Ahem*^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4568 (mes)
- "Just as I've warned you, this attempt to restore the Sobbling Starlight failed because the anvil you gave me wasn't up to the job. I'm sorry about that."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4569 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4570 (mes)
- "However, I only"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4571 (mes)
- "broke all of the tools"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4572 (mes)
- "and the ore pieces are still intact. Now, if you bring me the tools one more time, I can try this again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4573 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4574 (mes)
- "Since I'm a bit more familiar with this material, I won't take so much time. Once again, let me tell you which things you need to bring..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4575 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4576 (mes)
- "^FF00005 Mini Furnace^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4577 (mes)
- "^FF00002 Oridecon Hammer^000000,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4578 (mes)
- "and ^ff00001 good quality Anvil^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4579 (mes)
- "And this time, bring"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4580 (mes)
- "me a better anvil, huh?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4581 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4582 (mes)
- "Although it'd be perfect if I had an Emperium Anvil, I'm pretty sure it'll be alright if we used a Golden Anvil."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4583 (mes)
- "Oh good, you're back."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4584 (mes)
- "I've got some bad news,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4585 (mes)
- "so please don't overreact~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4586 (mes)
- "Um, are you ready?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4587 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4588 (mes)
- "While I was trying to restore the "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4589 (mes)
- "Sobbling Starlight, I was attacked "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4590 (mes)
- "by monsters all of a sudden. If only"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4591 (mes)
- "I paid more attention to my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4592 (mes)
- "surroundings..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4593 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4594 (mes)
- "Please understand that I get very deeply engrossed in my smithing work. If you don't mind, I'll try this again you'll bring all the tools just like the last time."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4595 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4596 (mes)
- "^FF00005 Mini Furnace^000000 and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4597 (mes)
- "^FF00002 Oridecon Hammer^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4598 (mes)
- "Don't forget the ^FF0000Golden Anvil^000000! But if you can get your hands on one, an ^FF0000Emperium Anvil^000000 would be better."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4599 (mes)
- "Didn't I tell you to bring me a Golden Anvil or an Emperium Anvil? Anything less isn't good enough to do any restoration work on this Sobbing Starlight."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4600 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4601 (mes)
- "Next time you come"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4602 (mes)
- "here, bring a Golden or Emperium Anvil and make sure to leave all of your other anvils in Kafra Storage or something, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4603 (mes)
- "Good, good."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4604 (mes)
- "I see that you've brought a Golden Anvil. Now I can get started right away! Still, I'm a little about those monsters showing up again, so would you keep a lookout?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4605 (mes)
- "Excellent! You've brought an Emperium Anvil! Now, keep a lookout for monsters while I repair these ore fragments. We can't have those beasts ruin my work again, right? Thank you."
