#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4633 (mes)
- "Still don't have everything ready? That's fine, just take your time. So long as you haven't forgotten all the things that you need. I mean, how can you forget when you have such an important ore on you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4634 (mes)
- "How have you been doing lately? Feel free to ask me if you ever think that you need my expertise, alright?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4635 (mes)
- "How have you been"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4636 (mes)
- "doing lately? You seem"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4637 (mes)
- "quite well. So is there anything"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4638 (mes)
- "I can help you with today?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4639 (select)
- "I need your help again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4640 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4641 (mes)
- "Haha, so what have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4642 (mes)
- "you brought me this time?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4643 (mes)
- "It must be fairly important if you've brought it all the way"
