#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4644 (mes)
- "down here."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4645 (select)
- "Please look at this."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4646 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4647 (mes)
- "Isn't this...?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4648 (mes)
- "Amazing, just by looking at it,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4649 (mes)
- "I can feel its power! You really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4650 (mes)
- "are something! How do you come across all of this amazing stuff?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4651 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4652 (mes)
- "You know, I consider myself"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4653 (mes)
- "lucky to even see this kind of stuff. Most smiths might be able to see this kind of thing only once in their entire lives. And to be able to work on it..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4654 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4655 (mes)
- "Hmmm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4656 (mes)
- "It's going to take quite"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4657 (mes)
- "a while to work on this. Unfortunately, I can't even"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4658 (mes)
- "give you a time estimate..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4659 (mes)
- "But I'll do my best for you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4660 (mes)
- "It's so..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4661 (mes)
- "Beautiful! I don't know"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4662 (mes)
- "if I'll ever see anything"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4663 (mes)
- "like this again in my life..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4664 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4665 (mes)
- "Oh, you're back just in time."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4666 (mes)
- "Although it was one of my most difficult jobs, I believe you'll be pleased with my work. Only a few smiths are privileged enough to work with this, even just once."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4667 (mes)
- "[Engel]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4668 (mes)
- "This is now yours to keep."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4669 (mes)
- "Thank you for giving me the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4670 (mes)
- "honor of working on a worthy"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4671 (mes)
- "smithing challenge."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4672 (mes)
- "I haven't completed it yet, but please understand that I've got to be really careful when working with something so valuable. But don't worry, its inner power will be revealed when I'm finished."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4673 (mes)
- "Sometimes, you can only"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4674 (mes)
- "improve yourself by training in solitude. But don't ever forget about the ones who really care about you. It's those people who make everything worth it."
