+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4950 (mes)
- "There are many things out"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4951 (mes)
- "there that defy our understanding of the world and are beyond our imagination. Many fear the unknown, but the truly brave will always seek out the truth."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4953 (mes)
- "^6B8E23It seems that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4954 (mes)
- "something in the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4955 (mes)
- "vicinity is reacting"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4956 (mes)
- "with the Sobbing Starlight"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4957 (mes)
- "in your possession. Perhaps"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4958 (mes)
- "you can find it nearby...^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4959 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4960 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4961 (mes)
- "What the...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4962 (mes)
- "What's happening?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4963 (mes)
- "^3355FFFor some reason, in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4964 (mes)
- "this particular spot, the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4965 (mes)
- "Sobbing Starlight is reacting"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4966 (mes)
- "with the Resin, Stone Hearts"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4967 (mes)
- "and Coral Reefs that you're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4968 (mes)
- "holding. All the objects are"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4969 (mes)
- "violently resonating...^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4970 (mes)
- "^3355FFAll of a sudden these"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4971 (mes)
- "objects emit a bright flash"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4972 (mes)
- "of light that envelops your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4973 (mes)
- "entire body, then you gently"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4974 (mes)
- "fall into unconsciousness...^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4976 (mes)
- "^3355FFNothing seems to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4977 (mes)
- "happen when you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4978 (mes)
- "approach this area now.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4981 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4982 (mes)
- "Only the chosen"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4983 (mes)
- "can enter this place."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4984 (mes)
- "I will not ask how you've"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4985 (mes)
- "gained entrance, but I will"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4986 (mes)
- "require you to leave."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4988 (mes)
- "Welcome, "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4989 (mes)
- ","
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4990 (mes)
- "to this realm of holiness."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4991 (mes)
- "You have endured great difficulty and tested your courage to obtain the Sobbing Starlight, which will be the certificate for your test."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4992 (select)
- "Test...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4993 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4994 (mes)
- "The gods have decided that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4995 (mes)
- "you are worthy of undergoing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4996 (mes)
- "a special test that will judge"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4997 (mes)
- "your merits. If you are a true"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4998 (mes)
- "hero who is pure of heart,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#4999 (mes)
- "you will certainly succeed..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5000 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5001 (mes)
- "Now, there is a critical"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5002 (mes)
- "situation in the ^FF0000realm where"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5003 (mes)
- "the fallen warriors dwell^000000. The"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5004 (mes)
- "gods wish for you to restore the balance by quelling a specific"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5005 (mes)
- "evil influence in that place."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5006 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5007 (mes)
- "There will be many obstacles."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5008 (mes)
- "First, the fallen, who will target their anger and hatred towards"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5009 (mes)
- "you. Where they have failed to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5010 (mes)
- "enter Valhalla, you have a rare"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5011 (mes)
- "and wondrous opportunity..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5012 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5013 (mes)
- "Secondly, and more"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5014 (mes)
- "importantly, you must find"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5015 (mes)
- "this evil influence on your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5016 (mes)
- "own. This will judge your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5017 (mes)
- "ability to discern good from evil. Do not trust appearances..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5018 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5019 (mes)
- "This is your task."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5020 (mes)
- "I cannot tell you more."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5021 (mes)
- "It is now your duty to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5022 (mes)
- "travel there and ferret"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5023 (mes)
- "out true darkness from"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5024 (mes)
- "one of the hearts there..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5026 (mes)
- "I commend your ability"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5027 (mes)
- "to survive in the realm"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5028 (mes)
- "of the dead. I imagine it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5029 (mes)
- "must be very difficult for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5030 (mes)
- "a mortal to endure its cruelty."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5031 (mes)
- "Regrettably, I can't really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5032 (mes)
- "provide any answers for you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5033 (mes)
- "You must overcome the ordeals"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5034 (mes)
- "of the gods on your own. All I can do is offer my guidance and prayer. ^FFFFFFcobo^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5035 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5036 (mes)
- "Remember that the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5037 (mes)
- "demonstration of your belief,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5038 (mes)
- "rather than the decision to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5039 (mes)
- "blindly adhere to faith, is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5040 (mes)
- "what the gods want to see."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5041 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5042 (mes)
- "Always step forward"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5043 (mes)
- "with wisdom and courage."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5044 (mes)
- "That is all I can tell you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5045 (mes)
- "Welcome back."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5046 (mes)
- "Not only have you passed the trials that the gods have set for you, you have tested your courage in the realm of the dead and protected Midgard from attack."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5047 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5048 (mes)
- "I'm pleased to announce that the gods have been watching you and decided to invite you to Valhalla. However, Midgard still has great need of you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5049 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5050 (mes)
- "As a symbol of this promise to invite you to Valhalla, you shall be rewarded with 'The Sign' which will show all others that you are a great warrior whose courage was tested by the gods themselves."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5051 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5052 (mes)
- "Congratulations,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5054 (mes)
- ". Verily,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5055 (mes)
- "you are an honorable"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5056 (mes)
- "hero worthy of praise!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5057 (mes)
- "The gods are watching"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5058 (mes)
- "you. Prove your courage,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5059 (mes)
- "and at that moment, you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5060 (mes)
- "will earn the honor of being"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5061 (mes)
- "selected by the gods."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5062 (mes)
- "You have yet to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5063 (mes)
- "fully prove your courage."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5064 (mes)
- "Once you do, you will be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5065 (mes)
- "summoned by the gods."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5066 (mes)
- "The gods are disappointed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5067 (mes)
- "in what you have decided to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5068 (mes)
- "do. Unfortunately, you have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5069 (mes)
- "been banished from Valhalla"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5070 (mes)
- "and this place as well."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5071 (mes)
- "[Valkyrie Sandra]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5072 (mes)
- "Although you have failed,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5073 (mes)
- "I hope that you find your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5074 (mes)
- "another way to win back"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5075 (mes)
- "the favor of the gods..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5076 (mes)
- "Only the chosen"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5077 (mes)
- "can enter this place."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5078 (mes)
- "I will not ask how you've"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5079 (mes)
- "gained entrance, but I will"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5080 (mes)
- "require you to leave."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5082 (mes)
- "Great warrior,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5083 (mes)
- "your time has not yet"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5084 (mes)
- "come. Please focus on"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5085 (mes)
- "your training until you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5086 (mes)
- "are summoned by the gods..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5095 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5096 (mes)
- "....?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5097 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5098 (mes)
- "As its magic power grows,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5099 (mes)
- "the Magic Circle is nearing completion. The symbol which I've asked you for is the last material needed for summoning Dark Lord."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5100 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5101 (mes)
- "However, the power of that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5102 (mes)
- "symbol can be used to complete"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5103 (mes)
- "the Magic Circle or destroy it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5104 (mes)
- "Would you hand it over to me?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5105 (mes)
- "I choose to destroy this..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5106 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5107 (mes)
- "Please..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5108 (mes)
- "Let me have the symbol."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5109 (select)
- "Give Serin the symbol."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5110 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5111 (mes)
- "This could be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5112 (mes)
- "pretty dangerous"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5113 (mes)
- "so please step back..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5117 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5118 (mes)
- "I'm sorry."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5119 (mes)
- "But I have to do this"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5120 (mes)
- "to summon Dark Lord."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5121 (select)
- "But why...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5122 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5123 (mes)
- "It was never the witch"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5124 (mes)
- "that wanted Dark Lord summoned,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5125 (mes)
- "but me. I've always wanted to return to my human form. I'm sick and tired of being bound here in Niflheim!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5126 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5127 (mes)
- "Unfortunately, the symbol"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5128 (mes)
- "which Lady Hell gave you is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5129 (mes)
- "limited to a one time use. Its"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5130 (mes)
- "power wasn't enough to bring me"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5131 (mes)
- "back, so summoning Dark Lord is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5132 (mes)
- "my last chance."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5133 (select)
- "But if Dark Lord comes to Midgard..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5134 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5135 (mes)
- "Oh, I'm pretty sure of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5136 (mes)
- "what will happen if Dark Lord"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5137 (mes)
- "enters the realm of the living. He'll destroy Midgard and bring death to thousands and thousands of people."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5138 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5139 (mes)
- "So if I came back to life"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5140 (mes)
- "and everyone else were dead,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5141 (mes)
- "However, by summoning Dark Lord,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5142 (mes)
- "you might be thinking it'd be pretty pointless for me to come back. But you know what? I don't care."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5143 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5144 (mes)
- "The living don't appreciate"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5145 (mes)
- "what they have, so they ought"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5146 (mes)
- "to be punished. They can all go to Niflheim while I enjoy the warmth of the sun and the fresh outside air."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5147 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5148 (mes)
- "Maybe you might not"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5149 (mes)
- "pity my situation since you've"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5150 (mes)
- "never been bound to Niflheim,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5151 (mes)
- "but I'm begging you. Don't get"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5152 (mes)
- "in my way."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5153 (select)
- "Alright. I'll let you go.:No, you have to be stopped."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5154 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5155 (mes)
- "Are you really willing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5156 (mes)
- "to throw so much away for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5157 (mes)
- "my sake? You do understand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5158 (mes)
- "that you'll be failing the ordeals set before you by the gods..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5159 (select)
- "I changed my mind for Midgard.:I do, and it's alright..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5160 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5161 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5162 (mes)
- "I really don't want to fight you,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5163 (mes)
- "but I've come too far to give up now. If you insist on interfering, then you leave me no choice..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5165 (mes)
- "[Dark Lord]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5166 (mes)
- "^330033Insolent mortal!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5167 (mes)
- "Do you really think"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5168 (mes)
- "you have a chance of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5169 (mes)
- "stopping me? Hmpf."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5170 (mes)
- "Every fool must learn."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5171 (mes)
- "Prepare to die!^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5175 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5176 (mes)
- "The least I can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5177 (mes)
- "do is send you back"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5178 (mes)
- "to Midgard and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5179 (mes)
- "ask the Dark Lord to spare"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5180 (mes)
- "you. Thank you so much..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5183 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5184 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5185 (mes)
- "I really don't want to fight you,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5186 (mes)
- "but I've come too far to give up now. If you insist on interfering, then you leave me no choice..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5188 (mes)
- "[Dark Lord]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5189 (mes)
- "^330033Insolent mortal!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5190 (mes)
- "Do you really think"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5191 (mes)
- "you have a chance of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5192 (mes)
- "stopping me? Hmpf."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5193 (mes)
- "Every fool must learn."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5194 (mes)
- "Prepare to die!^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5198 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5199 (mes)
- "I see now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5200 (mes)
- "Soon, I'll lose my memories"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5201 (mes)
- "and remain dead in Niflheim."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5202 (mes)
- "Just like all the others. Still,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5203 (mes)
- "may I ask you one question?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5204 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5205 (mes)
- "With that symbol, you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5206 (mes)
- "could order the dead to do"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5207 (mes)
- "whatever you want. Why didn't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5208 (mes)
- "you use it to command me to quit?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5209 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5210 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5211 (mes)
- "......"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5212 (mes)
- ".........."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5213 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5214 (mes)
- "I see it now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5215 (mes)
- "The kindness in your eyes"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5216 (mes)
- "tells me everything. You wanted to give me another chance. But in the end, I managed to destroy the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5217 (mes)
- "chance you had given me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5218 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5219 (mes)
- "Even though I'm nothing but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5220 (mes)
- "a spirit now, it was an honor"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5221 (mes)
- "for me to meet somebody like you. Although I'll lose my memories, I'll try not to forget you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5222 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5223 (mes)
- "My memories of your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5224 (mes)
- "courage and kindness"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5225 (mes)
- "are more precious to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5226 (mes)
- "me than life itself."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5227 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5228 (mes)
- "Farewell, now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5229 (mes)
- "And good luck on"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5230 (mes)
- "your travels, my friend..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5231 (mes)
- "^3355FFYou helped the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5232 (mes)
- "unconscious Serin"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5233 (mes)
- "and returned to Niflheim.^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5235 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5236 (mes)
- "Even though you tried"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5237 (mes)
- "to stop me, I still don't wish"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5238 (mes)
- "to take your life. I understand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5239 (mes)
- "that you've merely trying to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5240 (mes)
- "protect your Midgard."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5241 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5242 (mes)
- "However..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5243 (mes)
- "I do not think you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5244 (mes)
- "have the courage to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5245 (mes)
- "overcome the ordeals "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5246 (mes)
- "of the gods. Please don't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5247 (mes)
- "come here anymore..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5248 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5249 (mes)
- "Farewell..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5251 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5252 (mes)
- "Haven't you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5253 (mes)
- "given up yet?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5254 (mes)
- "Please don't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5255 (mes)
- "try to stop me!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5259 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5260 (mes)
- "Even though you tried"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5261 (mes)
- "to stop me, I still don't wish"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5262 (mes)
- "to take your life. I understand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5263 (mes)
- "that you've merely trying to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5264 (mes)
- "protect your Midgard."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5265 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5266 (mes)
- "However..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5267 (mes)
- "I do not think you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5268 (mes)
- "have the courage to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5269 (mes)
- "overcome the ordeals "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5270 (mes)
- "of the gods. Please don't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5271 (mes)
- "come here anymore..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5272 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5273 (mes)
- "Farewell..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5275 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5276 (mes)
- "Haven't you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5277 (mes)
- "given up yet?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5278 (mes)
- "Please don't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5279 (mes)
- "try to stop me!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5283 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5284 (mes)
- "Let me guide"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5285 (mes)
- "you to where"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5286 (mes)
- "you belong."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5288 (mes)
- ".........."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5292 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5293 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5294 (mes)
- "......"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5295 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5296 (mes)
- "You're finally here."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5297 (mes)
- "That witch has been watching"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5298 (mes)
- "my every move, so she probably"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5299 (mes)
- "knows what I'm up to by now..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5300 (select)
- "Why are you doing this..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5301 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5302 (mes)
- "You don't understand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5303 (mes)
- "the horrific experience"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5304 (mes)
- "of being bound to Niflheim."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5305 (mes)
- "I'm sick of breathing death"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5306 (mes)
- "and feeding on despair."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5307 (mes)
- "I want to live again!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5308 (select)
- "Is that why you want Dark Lord...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5309 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5310 (mes)
- "Unfortunately, the symbol"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5311 (mes)
- "which Lady Hell gave you is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5312 (mes)
- "limited to a one time use. Its"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5313 (mes)
- "power wasn't enough to bring me"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5314 (mes)
- "back, so summoning Dark Lord is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5315 (mes)
- "my last chance."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5316 (select)
- "But if Dark Lord comes to Midgard..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5317 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5318 (mes)
- "Oh, I'm pretty sure of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5319 (mes)
- "what will happen if Dark Lord"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5320 (mes)
- "enters the realm of the living. He'll destroy Midgard and bring death to thousands and thousands of people."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5321 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5322 (mes)
- "So if I came back to life"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5323 (mes)
- "and everyone else were dead,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5324 (mes)
- "However, by summoning Dark"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5325 (mes)
- "Lord, you might be thinking it'd be pretty pointless for me to come back. But I don't care."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5326 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5327 (mes)
- "The living don't appreciate"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5328 (mes)
- "what they have, so they ought"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5329 (mes)
- "to be punished. They can all go to Niflheim while I enjoy the warmth of the sun and the fresh outside air. Everyone should die..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5330 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5331 (mes)
- "Maybe you might not"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5332 (mes)
- "pity my situation since you've"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5333 (mes)
- "never been bound to Niflheim,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5334 (mes)
- "but I'm begging you. Don't get"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5335 (mes)
- "in my way, "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5336 (mes)
- "."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5337 (select)
- "I can't let you do this!:Okay, have it your way."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5338 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5339 (mes)
- "Are you really willing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5340 (mes)
- "to throw so much away for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5341 (mes)
- "my sake? You do understand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5342 (mes)
- "that you'll be failing the ordeals set before you by the gods..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5343 (select)
- "I changed my mind for Midgard.:I do, and it's alright..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5344 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5345 (mes)
- "The least I can"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5346 (mes)
- "do is send you back"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5347 (mes)
- "to Midgard and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5348 (mes)
- "ask the Dark Lord to spare"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5349 (mes)
- "you. Thank you so much..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5351 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5352 (mes)
- "If you think that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5353 (mes)
- "I can't summon Dark Lord"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5354 (mes)
- "without the symbol, then you're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5355 (mes)
- "mistaken. I've been collecting"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5356 (mes)
- "the power of despair!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5357 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5358 (mes)
- "Do you remember what"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5359 (mes)
- "happened to the dead that you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5360 (mes)
- "helped on my behalf? Even if they seemed to have found shelter at first, they cannot escape my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5361 (mes)
- "deep hollow of despair..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5362 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5363 (mes)
- "And that poor little girl,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5364 (mes)
- "Alakina Anne? She still"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5365 (mes)
- "hasn't realized that she's dead!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5366 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5367 (mes)
- "You gave her hope,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5368 (mes)
- "but ultimately, you can't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5369 (mes)
- "keep your promise to bring her home. Oh, her disappointment"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5370 (mes)
- "must be so crushing..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5371 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5372 (mes)
- "Yes..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5373 (mes)
- "By trying to help,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5374 (mes)
- "you gave them nothing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5375 (mes)
- "but pain, just as I planned."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5376 (mes)
- "Now I have enough despair"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5377 (mes)
- "to summon Dark Lord!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5378 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5379 (mes)
- "I don't want us to fight,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5380 (mes)
- "but I can't let you stop me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5381 (mes)
- "I've already sold my soul to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5382 (mes)
- "Dark Lord to become a living"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5383 (mes)
- "human again so I can't give up"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5384 (mes)
- "now! We'll have to battle!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5387 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5388 (mes)
- "If you think that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5389 (mes)
- "I can't summon Dark Lord"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5390 (mes)
- "without the symbol, then you're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5391 (mes)
- "mistaken. I've been collecting"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5392 (mes)
- "the power of despair!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5393 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5394 (mes)
- "What most adventurers"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5395 (mes)
- "don't know is that many of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5396 (mes)
- "souls in Niflheim are simply"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5397 (mes)
- "doomed to suffer. That's the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5398 (mes)
- "nature of this realm and one"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5399 (mes)
- "of the rules of balance..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5400 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5401 (mes)
- "It was child's play to ask"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5402 (mes)
- "some adventurers to help"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5403 (mes)
- "these souls. But once they learn that these souls can't be helped,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5404 (mes)
- "it's too late! In failing them, the adventurers add to their despair!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5405 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5406 (mes)
- "And by increasing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5407 (mes)
- "the despair here, it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5408 (mes)
- "also adds to the power I'll"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5409 (mes)
- "use to summon Dark Lord!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5410 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5411 (mes)
- "I don't want us to fight,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5412 (mes)
- "but I can't let you stop me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5413 (mes)
- "I've already sold my soul to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5414 (mes)
- "Dark Lord to become a living"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5415 (mes)
- "human again so I can't give up"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5416 (mes)
- "now! We'll have to battle!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5419 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5420 (mes)
- "I see now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5421 (mes)
- "Soon, I'll lose my memories"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5422 (mes)
- "and remain dead in Niflheim."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5423 (mes)
- "Just like all the others. Still,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5424 (mes)
- "may I ask you one question?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5425 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5426 (mes)
- "With that symbol, you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5427 (mes)
- "could order the dead to do"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5428 (mes)
- "whatever you want. Why didn't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5429 (mes)
- "you use it to command me to quit?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5430 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5431 (mes)
- "..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5432 (mes)
- "......"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5433 (mes)
- ".........."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5434 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5435 (mes)
- "I see it now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5436 (mes)
- "The kindness in your eyes"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5437 (mes)
- "tells me everything. You wanted to give me another chance. But in the end, I managed to destroy the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5438 (mes)
- "chance you had given me."
+ ""
