- "your help to get out of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5562 (mes)
- "here as soon as I can~"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5563 (select)
- "Er, I'm busy, now that I think about it.:Sure, let's do it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5564 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5565 (mes)
- "I know I can't stop"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5566 (mes)
- "you from pursing your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5567 (mes)
- "path to glory. But if you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5568 (mes)
- "should change your mind...!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5569 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5570 (mes)
- "I know I'm asking too much"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5571 (mes)
- "of you, but if you'd also help"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5572 (mes)
- "the other unfortunate souls in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5573 (mes)
