- "Sure, why not?:Why should I help them?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5575 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5576 (mes)
- "I knew you'd understand!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5577 (mes)
- "You really are a kind person."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5578 (mes)
- "Now, in order to help the other"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5579 (mes)
- "misfortunate in Niflheim, you've got to remember to gain their trust first and get close to them, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5580 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5581 (mes)
- "I... I understand."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5582 (mes)
- "Although I asked too much in asking you to help the other people here, I was hoping you'd realize that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5583 (mes)
- "would be the best way to learn clues for a way to escape for now."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5584 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5585 (mes)
- "Hmm...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5586 (mes)
- "You don't know which"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5587 (mes)
- "people you need to help"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5588 (mes)
- "here in Niflheim? Mmm,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5589 (mes)
- "let me think about it..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5590 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5591 (mes)
- "In this doomed place,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5592 (mes)
- "there isn't too much trust"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5593 (mes)
- "amongst some of the people"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5594 (mes)
- "here, but some will share their"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5595 (mes)
- "problems if you ^3355FFapproach them"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5596 (mes)
