+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5613 (mes)
- "prey or good marks."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5614 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5615 (mes)
- "Hello, adventurer."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5616 (mes)
- "How have you been doing?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5617 (mes)
- "I'm surprised to still see you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5618 (mes)
- "around this dangerous town."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5619 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5620 (mes)
- "If you wander around"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5621 (mes)
- "Niflheim, you'll find that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5622 (mes)
- "some of the deceased here are"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5623 (mes)
- "different than most of the others in this town. Please talk to them and see if you can be of any help."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5624 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5625 (mes)
- "There's a Bard in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5626 (mes)
- "Niflheim with a very"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5627 (mes)
- "sweet, yet melancholy voice."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5628 (mes)
- "He sings for strangers just"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5629 (mes)
- "like you, adventurer."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5630 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5631 (mes)
- "I think he might know"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5632 (mes)
- "some useful information,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5633 (mes)
- "so it might be a good"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5634 (mes)
- "idea to speak with him."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5635 (mes)
- "[Serin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5636 (mes)
- "Hello, "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5637 (mes)
- ","
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5638 (mes)
- "I'm surprised that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5639 (mes)
- "you've managed to survive"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#5640 (mes)
- "here all this time. It's no small feat for a mortal to be able to remain alive in Niflheim..."
+ ""
