#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6347 (mes)
- "vouchers I've lent to you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6348 (mes)
- "Please retrieve them all"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6349 (mes)
- "before coming back to me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6350 (mes)
- "You've done well."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6351 (mes)
- "Without her memories of her"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6352 (mes)
- "previous life, Serin can remain"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6353 (mes)
- "here in Niflheim peacefully."
