#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6354 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6355 (mes)
- "Although she failed to return to life, I'm sure she is glad to have met you. I think she's also started to learn that life's meaning is not in living alone..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6356 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6357 (mes)
- "Once again, thank"
