#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6358 (mes)
- "you so much for your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6359 (mes)
- "help. Once you finish here,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6360 (mes)
- "please visit our queen, Lady Hell. I believe she wants to see you for some reason..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6361 (mes)
- "I'm so relieved that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6362 (mes)
- "my expectations about"
