#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6363 (mes)
- "you weren't wrong."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6364 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6365 (mes)
- "You've done well."
