+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6371 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6372 (mes)
- "Once again, thank"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6373 (mes)
- "you so much for your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6374 (mes)
- "help. Once you finish here,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6375 (mes)
- "please visit our queen, Lady Hell. I believe she wants to see you for some reason..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6376 (mes)
- "How could you fail when"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6377 (mes)
- "the stakes are so high?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6378 (mes)
- "Serin almost summoned"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6379 (mes)
- "the Dark Lord, but luckily,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6380 (mes)
- "somebody else stopped"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6381 (mes)
- "her in the nick of time."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6382 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6383 (mes)
- "Fortunately, there are many people who are coming to Niflheim as part of the ordeals set before them by the gods. It looks like you just failed that ordeal, and Valkyrie will choose someone else."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6384 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6385 (mes)
- "It's over. You failed."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6386 (mes)
- "Still, consider yourself"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6387 (mes)
- "lucky. Your soul could have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6388 (mes)
- "been bound to Niflheim if it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6389 (mes)
- "weren't for Serin's wish for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6390 (mes)
- "you to remain free."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6391 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6392 (mes)
- "You really should thank"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6393 (mes)
- "her for that. Though, it's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6394 (mes)
- "ironic that you failed your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6395 (mes)
- "ordeals for her sake..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6396 (mes)
- "Hmpf."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6397 (mes)
- "I don't really"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6398 (mes)
- "want to talk to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6399 (mes)
- "you anymore."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6400 (mes)
- "You've got to hurry"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6401 (mes)
- "and stop Serin!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6402 (mes)
- "Hm? Still exploring"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6403 (mes)
- "Niflheim? Although you're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6404 (mes)
- "strong enough to survive,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6405 (mes)
- "I still think you're risking"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6406 (mes)
- "your life by remaining here"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6407 (mes)
- "when you don't have to."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6409 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6410 (mes)
- "W-what's this?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6411 (mes)
- "Why is it that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6412 (mes)
- "you have one of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6413 (mes)
- "my lost spell books?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6414 (select)
- "From a cursed soul..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6415 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6416 (mes)
- "Oh. That bastard must have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6417 (mes)
- "stolen my spell books and got cursed when he cast the spells without my permission. Still, it's a relief to have my spells back."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6418 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6419 (mes)
- "So mortal..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6420 (mes)
- "You must be here for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6421 (mes)
- "some reason. Speak"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6422 (mes)
- "your mind."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6423 (select)
- "Send me back to my world.:There's a lost child here that I want to help..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6424 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6425 (mes)
- "Understood."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6426 (mes)
- "Let me send"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6427 (mes)
- "you back to the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6428 (mes)
- "realm of the living"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6429 (mes)
- "where you belong..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6431 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6432 (mes)
- "There's a living child?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6433 (mes)
- "Here in Niflheim? That's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6434 (mes)
- "most peculiar. Well, let me"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6435 (mes)
- "give you this. It will send"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6436 (mes)
- "a living human back to one"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6437 (mes)
- "of the towns in your realm."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6438 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6439 (mes)
- "A mortal? What are you doing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6440 (mes)
- "here? I'm not sure how more"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6441 (mes)
- "of you are able to get here,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6442 (mes)
- "or your reasons for coming,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6443 (mes)
- "but this place is dangerous"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6444 (mes)
- "for the living."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6445 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6446 (mes)
- "I'm sending you back"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6447 (mes)
- "to the realm of the living."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6448 (mes)
- "If you can help it, you should"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6449 (mes)
- "probably avoid coming back"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6450 (mes)
- "to Niflheim..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6452 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6453 (mes)
- "You lost the wing?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6454 (mes)
- "Here, let me give you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6455 (mes)
- "my last one. Now, hurry"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6456 (mes)
- "up and save that lost child!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6457 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6458 (mes)
- "I just gave you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6459 (mes)
- "that wing, right?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6460 (mes)
- "Hurry and save that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6461 (mes)
- "poor child stuck in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6462 (mes)
- "Niflheim!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6463 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6464 (mes)
- "Hmm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6465 (mes)
- "If you don't have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6466 (mes)
- "anything important to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6467 (mes)
- "accomplish in Niflheim,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6468 (mes)
- "you should probably return"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6469 (mes)
- "to the realm of the living..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6470 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6471 (mes)
- "So did you already"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6472 (mes)
- "use the wing to save"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6473 (mes)
- "that poor, lost child?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6474 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6475 (mes)
- "What...?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6476 (mes)
- "It didn't work?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6477 (mes)
- "That's impossible!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6478 (mes)
- "Wait, give me a moment to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6479 (mes)
- "think. What could be wrong?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6480 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6481 (mes)
- "Alright."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6482 (mes)
- "Now I understand"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6483 (mes)
- "why the wing didn't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6484 (mes)
- "work for that poor girl..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6485 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6486 (mes)
- "She's so young that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6487 (mes)
- "she doesn't even know"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6488 (mes)
- "that she's dead. It's tragic,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6489 (mes)
- "but there's no way for her"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6490 (mes)
- "to get out of here..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6491 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6492 (mes)
- "When people don't fully"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6493 (mes)
- "know the situation that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6494 (mes)
- "they're in, they become more"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6495 (mes)
- "willing to take their chances."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6496 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6497 (mes)
- "When people don't fully"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6498 (mes)
- "know the situation that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6499 (mes)
- "they're in, they become more"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6500 (mes)
- "willing to take their chances."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6501 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6502 (mes)
- "As I expected,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6503 (mes)
- "there is something behind"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6504 (mes)
- "all of this. Now, you may"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6505 (mes)
- "know where you are, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6506 (mes)
- "do you understand why"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6507 (mes)
- "the dead are here?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6508 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6509 (mes)
- "This realm is a place"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6510 (mes)
- "for warriors that have failed"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6511 (mes)
- "to prove their courage. Keep in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6512 (mes)
- "mind that it's not too late for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6513 (mes)
- "you to join their ranks."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6514 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6515 (mes)
- "The realm of Niflheim"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6516 (mes)
- "is ruled by the Queen of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6517 (mes)
- "Dead. Sometimes she appears"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6518 (mes)
- "in her shining armor and makes the rounds. Everyone who sees her is stunned by the image of authority."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6519 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6520 (mes)
- "Now..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6521 (mes)
- "What I need you to do is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6522 (mes)
- "ask the Queen of the Dead"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6523 (mes)
- "for the Symbol of Nine Realms."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6524 (select)
- "What is that?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6525 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6526 (mes)
- "The symbol acts as"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6527 (mes)
- "a voucher of the queen's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6528 (mes)
- "authority and represents her"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6529 (mes)
- "undeniable right to rule over"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6530 (mes)
- "the dead. But right now, I can't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6531 (mes)
- "explain why I need it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6532 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6533 (mes)
- "I'll tell you why I need"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6534 (mes)
- "it once you bring me the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6535 (mes)
- "queen's symbol. Now, please"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6536 (mes)
- "keep this secret and tell no one that I asked you to bring the symbol to me."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6537 (select)
- "Alright, I understand.:How am I supposed to get the symbol?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6538 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6539 (mes)
- "Taking the symbol"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6540 (mes)
- "by force is out of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6541 (mes)
- "question. Not even the gods"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6542 (mes)
- "would consider battling the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6543 (mes)
- "Queen of the Dead."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6544 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6545 (mes)
- "You will need to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6546 (mes)
- "earn the queen's favor"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6547 (mes)
- "in order to even have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6548 (mes)
- "a chance of obtaining"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6549 (mes)
- "the Symbol of Nine Realms."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6550 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6551 (mes)
- "Now, there is a rumor"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6552 (mes)
- "that the Queen of the Dead"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6553 (mes)
- "is searching for her lost mother, Angrboda. Now, if you could find where Angrboda has been"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6554 (mes)
- "sealed away..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6555 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6556 (mes)
- "When you need to meet"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6557 (mes)
- "me from now on, go ahead"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6558 (mes)
- "and take the ^FF0000secret passage"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6559 (mes)
- "through the right side of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6560 (mes)
- "portrait on the second floor^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6561 (mes)
- "of this castle, "
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6562 (mes)
- "."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6563 (mes)
- "[Kirkena]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6564 (mes)
- "If you use that piano"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6565 (mes)
