+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6791 (mes)
- "And, off the record,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6792 (mes)
- "I think you should be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6793 (mes)
- "really careful if you find"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6794 (mes)
- "yourself dealing with Serin..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6795 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6796 (mes)
- "You know, I was an"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6797 (mes)
- "adventurer myself. In fact,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6798 (mes)
- "I even came here to Niflheim"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6799 (mes)
- "for the ordeals set by the gods. However, I failed and ended up being bound to this realm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6800 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6801 (mes)
- "I just wanted to warn you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6802 (mes)
- "Be careful and don't justify"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6803 (mes)
- "your greed for any sort of reward using the excuse that you're just gonna prove your courage."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6804 (mes)
- "That's what I did..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6805 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6806 (mes)
- "Anyway, I've already talked"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6807 (mes)
- "too much. First, go and see"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6808 (mes)
- "the witch and ask her to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6809 (mes)
- "help you out, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6810 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6811 (mes)
- "One last thing. Off the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6812 (mes)
- "record, I think you should"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6813 (mes)
- "be really careful if you find"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6814 (mes)
- "yourself dealing with Serin."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6815 (mes)
- "She seems nice enough, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6816 (mes)
- "something's weird about her."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6817 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6818 (mes)
- "She's awfully persuasive,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6819 (mes)
- "and the fact that she used"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6820 (mes)
- "to be a great wizard when she"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6821 (mes)
- "was alive bothers me. She's a lot different than the rest of the guys stuck in Niflheim..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6822 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6823 (mes)
- "Are you here"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6824 (mes)
- "to prove your"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6825 (mes)
- "courage to the gods?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6826 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6827 (mes)
- "You know, I was an"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6828 (mes)
- "adventurer myself. In fact,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6829 (mes)
- "I even came here to Niflheim"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6830 (mes)
- "for the ordeals set by the gods. However, I failed and ended up being bound to this realm..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6831 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6832 (mes)
- "I just wanted to warn you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6833 (mes)
- "Be careful and don't justify"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6834 (mes)
- "your greed for any sort of reward using the excuse that you're just gonna prove your courage."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6835 (mes)
- "That's what I did..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6836 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6837 (mes)
- "Anyway, I've already talked"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6838 (mes)
- "too much. First, go and see"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6839 (mes)
- "the witch and ask her to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6840 (mes)
- "help you out, okay?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6841 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6842 (mes)
- "Huh... I hear you're"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6843 (mes)
- "looking for something"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6844 (mes)
- "pretty important. It's going"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6845 (mes)
- "to be a dangerous search."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6846 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6847 (mes)
- "They are plenty of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6848 (mes)
- "other parties that are"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6849 (mes)
- "interested in the thing"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6850 (mes)
- "which you're seeking..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6851 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6852 (mes)
- "You must be a very"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6853 (mes)
- "resourceful mortal."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6854 (mes)
- "Not even Lady Hell, with"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6855 (mes)
- "all her power, could find"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6856 (mes)
- "the soul of her mother"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6857 (mes)
- "for a long time."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6858 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6859 (mes)
- "There's no need"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6860 (mes)
- "for me to hide my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6861 (mes)
- "true identity any longer."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6862 (mes)
- "My real name is Ganglati,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6863 (mes)
- "servant of Lady Hell, the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6864 (mes)
- "ruler of Niflheim."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6865 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6866 (mes)
- "Her highness would"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6867 (mes)
- "have words with you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6868 (mes)
- "Shall I send you to her"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6869 (mes)
- "mansion, Eljudnir,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6870 (mes)
- "right now?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6871 (select)
- "Yes:No"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6872 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6873 (mes)
- "Remember to be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6874 (mes)
- "careful and especially"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6875 (mes)
- "polite when you speak to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6876 (mes)
- "Lady Hell. Otherwise, the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6877 (mes)
- "consequences will be severe..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6879 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6880 (mes)
- "I understand."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6881 (mes)
- "Meeting with a deity is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6882 (mes)
- "no small matter. However,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6883 (mes)
- "I advise you to make haste"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6884 (mes)
- "as her highness is eager"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6885 (mes)
- "to see you soon."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6886 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6887 (mes)
- "You must be most favored"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6888 (mes)
- "to receive the Symbol of the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6889 (mes)
- "Nine Realms. Of course, it"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6890 (mes)
- "can be used only once, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6891 (mes)
- "it is still a great honor."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6892 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6893 (mes)
- "Once again, I ask that"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6894 (mes)
- "you be on guard against"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6895 (mes)
- "Serin. She may already be"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6896 (mes)
- "aware of what you plan to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6897 (mes)
- "do with this symbol..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6898 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6899 (mes)
- "You must hurry and"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6900 (mes)
- "stop the summoning"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6901 (mes)
- "before your world in"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6902 (mes)
- "cast into immense peril!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6903 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6904 (mes)
- "Although Lady Hell"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6905 (mes)
- "is being rather blase"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6906 (mes)
- "about this matter, I beseech"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6907 (mes)
- "you to do what you can for"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6908 (mes)
- "the realm of the living!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6909 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6910 (mes)
- "I should have"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6911 (mes)
- "known you couldn't"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6912 (mes)
- "stop her. Still, I had"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6913 (mes)
- "a little hope that you'd"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6914 (mes)
- "be able to do it."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6915 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6916 (mes)
- "Perhaps I expected"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6917 (mes)
- "far too much of you."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6918 (mes)
- "Goodbye for now, mortal."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6919 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6920 (mes)
- "You've done a great"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6921 (mes)
- "job of stopping Serin."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6922 (mes)
- "Excellent! Such great"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6923 (mes)
- "service on behalf of"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6924 (mes)
- "the realm of the living!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6925 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6926 (mes)
- "I'm pleased to inform"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6927 (mes)
- "you that you've been"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6928 (mes)
- "invited to Lady Hell's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6929 (mes)
- "mansion once again."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6930 (mes)
- "Are you ready to go?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6931 (select)
- "No, thanks.:Yes."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6932 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6933 (mes)
- "I see."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6934 (mes)
- "Well then, come"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6935 (mes)
- "back to me when you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6936 (mes)
- "feel fully prepared."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6937 (mes)
- "[Gen]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6938 (mes)
- "Good, good."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6939 (mes)
- "Don't forget to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6940 (mes)
- "speak to her highness"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6941 (mes)
- "with the utmost respect!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6947 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6948 (mes)
- "What? I look familiar to you?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6949 (mes)
- "Eh, you know what they say."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6950 (mes)
- "Everyone has a lookalike in the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6951 (mes)
- "world somewhere. Am I right"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6952 (mes)
- "or am I right?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6953 (mes)
- "Niflheim ain't such a bad"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6954 (mes)
- "place to live. Sure, Asgard's"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6955 (mes)
- "all pretty and stuff, but there's too many rules. In this place, you"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6956 (mes)
- "can enjoy a lot more freedom. After you get used to all the stink."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6957 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6958 (mes)
- "Did I say 'stink?'"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6959 (mes)
- "I meant... 'fragrance.'"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6960 (mes)
- "Alright, so the gods expelled"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6961 (mes)
- "me, but I really oughtta thank"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6962 (mes)
- "'em for sending me here!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6963 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6964 (mes)
- "What's that look for...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6965 (mes)
- "What, you can't believe"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6966 (mes)
- "that someone like me used"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6967 (mes)
- "to live in Valhalla? Me neither! They really made a mistake when they put me up to live in Asgard!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6968 (mes)
- "Angrboda...?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6969 (mes)
- "Yeah, yeah!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6970 (mes)
- "I remember hearing something"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6971 (mes)
- "about her when I usedta hang"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6972 (mes)
- "with the gods up in Asgard."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6973 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6974 (mes)
- "Yeah, those guys were pretty"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6975 (mes)
- "gangster about it. I mean, they took her soul, broke it in four pieces and stashed them in the deepest hole in Midgard!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6976 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6977 (mes)
- "Sure, she was a giant, but"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6978 (mes)
- "they were pretty scared of her."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6979 (mes)
- "All her children ended up to be legendary monsters! Well, I'm"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6980 (mes)
- "not sure if Lady Hell counts."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6981 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6982 (mes)
- "That's pretty harsh."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6983 (mes)
- "I mean, even if you die,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6984 (mes)
- "your soul has no place to"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6985 (mes)
- "rest. Angrboda's soul is"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6986 (mes)
- "all cut up and stuff!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6987 (select)
- "So where are the soul pieces again?"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6988 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6989 (mes)
- "What...? I just said,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6990 (mes)
- "the deepest underground"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6991 (mes)
- "place in Midgard."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6992 (mes)
- "It's a dangerous joint"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6993 (mes)
- "protected by gangs"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6994 (mes)
- "of monsters."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6995 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6996 (mes)
- "Wait, you tellin' me"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6997 (mes)
- "that you're gonna find"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6998 (mes)
- "all of Angrboda's soul?!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#6999 (mes)
- "You're crazy! If they end up"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7000 (mes)
- "missing, the gods'll know I was"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7001 (mes)
- "the one who tipped you off!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7002 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7003 (mes)
- "If I was gonna risk my soul,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7004 (mes)
- "I'd wanna enjoy the rest of my"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7005 (mes)
- "afterlife as my much as I could"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7006 (mes)
- "before the gods offed me. Man,"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7007 (mes)
- "I'd need at least 40,000 Zeny to even have a decent time..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7008 (select)
- "Pay Laichin 40,000 Zeny:Don't pay Laichin."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7009 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7010 (mes)
- "Hey..."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7011 (mes)
- "This is sooo"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7012 (mes)
- "not enough money"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7013 (mes)
- "for me to enjoy myself"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7014 (mes)
- "if my soul ends up getting"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7015 (mes)
- "busted by the gods."
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7016 (mes)
- "[Laichin]"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7017 (mes)
- "Now we're talkin'!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7018 (mes)
- "You're a true hero!"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7019 (mes)
- "Right, you gotta go to the"
+ ""
#: npc/quests/the_sign_quest.txt#7020 (mes)
